return ['domain'=>'zinn-chat','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-chat','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-05T16:57:09+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-05T16:57:09+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat','A complete help desk and AI assistant that runs on your own WordPress: an AI that answers from your own pages with links, live chat, and support tickets in wp-admin, on a submit-a-ticket page and in the WooCommerce account area. Under 10 KB on the page and no requests at all until a visitor opens it.'=>'Iranlọwọ olumulo ati oluranlọwọ AI pipe ti o nṣiṣẹ lori WordPress tirẹ: AI kan ti o dahun lati awọn oju-iwe tirẹ pẹlu awọn ọna asopọ, iwiregbe laaye, ati awọn tikẹti atilẹyin ni wp-admin, lori oju-iwe ifakalẹ tikẹti kan ati ni agbegbe akọọlẹ WooCommerce. Kere ju 10 KB sori oju-iwe naa ati pe ko si awọn ibeere rara titi ti alejo yoo fi ṣii.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Inbox'=>'Apoti ifiranṣẹ','Tickets'=>'Àwọn Tíkẹ́tì','Assistant'=>'Olùrànlọ́wọ́','Settings'=>'Eto','Setup'=>'Ètò','Zinn® Chat could not create its database tables:'=>'Zinn® Chat ko le ṣẹda awọn tabili ibi ipamọ data rẹ:','The AI assistant could not answer a visitor:'=>'Olùrànlọ́wọ́ AI kò lè dá àlejó kan lóhùn:','Fix it'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe rẹ','Loading…'=>'Ń baje...','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Oju-iwe yii nilo JavaScript.','Chat'=>'Chat','AI assistant'=>'Olùrànlọ́wọ́ AI','Tickets and email'=>'Àwọn tikẹti àti ímeèlì','Site index'=>'Atọka aaye','Privacy and spam'=>'Asiri ati spam','Connect to Zinn Digital®'=>'So pọ̀ mọ́ Zinn Digital®','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Àwọn olùṣojú AI (MCP)','Show the chat on the site'=>'Fi iwiregbe naa hàn lori aaye naa','Nothing appears on the site, and nothing is loaded, until this is ticked.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó hàn lórí ojú-wẹ́bù náà, bẹ́ẹ̀ ni kò sí ohun tó ń gbé wọlé, titi di ìgbà tí a ó fi sàmì sí èyí.','Chat title'=>'Àkọlé ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀','Greeting'=>'Kíkí','The first thing a visitor sees.'=>'Ohun akọkọ ti alejo kan ri.','Greeting when nobody can answer'=>'Ikini nigbati enikeni ko le dahun','Colour'=>'Àwọ̀','Text colour on the colour'=>'Àwọ̀ ìkọ̀wé lórí àwọ̀','Position'=>'Ipo','Bottom, end side (right in left-to-right languages)'=>'Ìsàlẹ̀, apá òpin (ọ̀tún ní àwọn èdè tí a ń kọ láti òsì sí ọ̀tún)','Bottom, start side'=>'Isale, egbé ibẹrẹ','Offer "Talk to a person"'=>'Funni ni "Sọ̀rọ̀ sí ènìyàn kan"','Shown while somebody has the Inbox open and is not set to away.'=>'Wọ́n ń fi hàn nígbà tí ẹnì kan bá ṣí Inpọ́ọ̀sì rẹ̀ (Inbox) tí kò sì fi hàn pé òun lọ sí ìsinmi.','Hide the chat from your support team while they are signed in'=>'Fi ìjíròrò náà pamọ́ kúrò lójú ẹ̀gbẹ́ ìtìlẹ́yìn rẹ̀ nígbà tí wọ́n bá wọ ilé iṣẹ́ náà','Show "Powered by Zinn® Chat" under the chat'=>'Fi "Powered by Zinn® Chat" han labẹ iwiregbe naa','Optional. Off unless you turn it on.'=>'Aṣayan. O wa ní papẹ́ ayafi tí o bá tan an.','Your chat texts in other languages'=>'Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ rẹ ní àwọn èdè mìíràn','With Tranzly, WPML or Polylang you do not need this: your texts are listed there with your other site texts (Tranzly: Menus and shared text, then "Site title, tagline and widgets"; WPML: String Translation, in the Zinn® Chat context; Polylang: Strings translations, in the Zinn® Chat group), and visitors see them in their own language. Without a multilingual plugin, write your own version for each language here, with its code (for example de, ar or pt_BR). A field left empty shows your main text.'=>'Pẹlu Tranzly, WPML tabi Polylang o ko nilo eyi: awọn ọrọ rẹ wa ni akojọ sibẹ pẹlu awọn ọrọ aaye rẹ miiran (Tranzly: Awọn akojọ aṣayan ati ọrọ ti a pin, lẹhinna "Akọle aaye, gbolohun ọrọ ati awọn wíjíìtì"; WPML: Itumọ Okun, ninu ipo Zinn® Chat; Polylang: Awọn itumọ awọn okun, ninu ẹgbẹ Zinn® Chat), ati pe awọn alejo rii wọn ni ede tiwọn. Laisi ohun itanna ti o ni ọpọlọpọ ede, kọ ẹya ti ara rẹ fun ede kọọkan nibi, pẹlu koodu rẹ (fun apẹẹrẹ de, ar tabi pt_BR). Aaye kan ti a fi silẹ ni ofifo yoo ṣafihan ọrọ akọkọ rẹ.','Let the AI assistant answer visitors'=>'Jẹ́ kí olùrànlọ́wọ́ AI dáhùn àwọn alábẹ̀wò','Assistant name'=>'Orúkọ olùrànlọ́wọ́','Extra instructions for the assistant'=>'Àfikùn ìtọ́sọ́nà fún olùrànlọ́wọ́','For example: "Always mention our 30-day returns." They cannot override the safety rules.'=>'Fún àpẹrẹ: "Máa sọ nípa ìdápadà ọjọ́ ọgbọ̀n wa nígbà gbogbo." Wọn kò le sọ di asán àwọn òfin ààbò náà.','Answer language'=>'Èdè ìdáhùn','"auto" answers in the visitor\'s own language; or a locale such as en_GB or de_DE to always answer in one language.'=>'"auto" dahun ni ede olubewo funra re; tabi agbegbe bi en_GB tabi de_DE lati dahun nigbagbogbo ni ede kan.','Minimum relevance'=>'Ìbáṣepọ̀ tó kéré jù','Passages scoring below this (0 to 0.95) are not used, and the assistant says it does not know. Check scores in the test console.'=>'Awọn apakan ti o gba ami-ayẹwo kekere ju eyi lọ (0 si 0.95) ni a kii lo, ati pe oluranlọwọ sọ pe ko mọ. Ṣayẹwo awọn ami-ayẹwo ninu kọnsọọlu idanwo naa.','Offer a person after this many unanswered questions'=>'Pèsè ìfilọ́lẹ̀ fún ẹnì kan lẹ́yìn àwọn àbáwọlé ìbéèrè tí kò rí ìgbèsì tó pọ̀ tó báyìí','Longest answer (tokens)'=>'Idahun ti o gun julọ (awọn ami-ọrọ)','Accept support tickets'=>'Gba àwọn tikẹti ìṣọ̀rọ̀','Support page'=>'Ojú-ewé àtìlẹyìn','The page with the [zinn_chat_support] shortcode or the Support page block. Ticket links in emails open this page.'=>'Ojú-ewé tó ní kọ́kọ́ ìkúrú [zinn_chat_support] tàbí bálóòkì ojú-ewé Ìtìlẹ́yìn. Àwọn àjápọ̀ títíkẹ̀tì nínú àwọn íméèlì máa ń ṣí ojú-ewé yìí.','Send team alerts to'=>'Fi awọn iṣọra ẹgbẹ ranṣẹ sí','One or more email addresses, separated by commas. Empty: the site admin email.'=>'Ẹ̀kọ́ kan tàbí jù bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ tí a fi kọmà ya sọtọ̀. Ó bá ń jẹ́ òfo: íméìlì alákòóso ojú òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà.','Sender name on emails'=>'Orukọ olufiranṣẹ lori awọn imeeli','Email the team when a visitor waits for a person longer than (minutes)'=>'Firanṣẹ imeeli si ẹgbẹ naa nigbati alejo kan ba duro de eniyan kan to ju (iṣẹju) lọ','Private ticket links work for (days after the last message)'=>'Àwọn àjápọ̀ tìkẹ́tì àṣírí ń ṣiṣẹ́ fún (ọjọ́ lẹ́yìn ìránṣẹ́ ìkẹyìn)','After that the page offers to email a new link.'=>'Lẹ́yìn yẹn ojú-ewé náà fúnni ní àṣàyàn láti fi ìjápọ̀ tuntun ránṣẹ́ nípasẹ̀ imeeli.','Add a Support tab to the WooCommerce account area'=>'Fi taabu Ìtìlẹ́yìn kún agbègbè akántì WooCommerce','Let the assistant tell signed-in customers about their own orders'=>'Jẹ́ kí olùrànlọ́wọ́ sọ fún àwọn oníbàárà tí wọ́n ti wọlé nípa àwọn àṣẹ wọn tirẹ̀','Answers "where is my order?" from the order status and tracking.'=>'Awọn idahun "ibo ni aṣẹ mi wa?" lati inu ipo aṣẹ ati titọpa.','Content the assistant reads'=>'Akoonu ti oluranlọwọ ka','None ticked means every public type.'=>'Kò sí èyí tí a fi àmì sí tí ó túmọ̀ sí gbogbo irú-ọmọ Tí ó wà fún gbogbo ènìyàn.','WooCommerce products, prices, stock, shipping and payment methods'=>'Àwọn ọjà WooCommerce, iye owó, ọjà tó kù, ìfijiṣẹ́, àti àwọn ọ̀nà ìsanwó','Forums (bbPress, BuddyBoss, wpForo)'=>'Àwọn fórómu (bbPress, BuddyBoss, wpForo)','Read pages as visitors see them when a page builder\'s content cannot be read directly'=>'Ka awọn oju-iwe bi awọn alejo ṣe n ri wọn nigbati a ko le ka akoonu oluṣe oju-iwe taara','Fetches the page from your own site in the background.'=>'Ó gba ojú-ewé náà láti ojú-ewé ayélujára rẹ ní abẹlẹ.','Never read these posts or pages (IDs)'=>'Má ka àwọn àfikún tàbí ojúewé wọ̀nyí rárá (àwọn ID)','Comma-separated.'=>'Ti a ya sọtọ pẹlu àmì àfihan àpapọ.','Ask visitors to agree before a chat or ticket'=>'Beere lọwọ awọn alejo lati gba ṣaaju iwiregke tabi tikẹti','Agreement text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ àdéhùn','Privacy policy link'=>'Ọna asopọ ėto asiri','Empty: the site\'s privacy policy page.'=>'Asan: oju-iwe eto awotẹlẹ ti aaye naa.','Delete finished chats and tickets after (days)'=>'Pa awọn iwiregbe ati awọn tikẹti ti o pari lẹhin (awọn ọjọ)','0 keeps them.'=>'0 mọ wọn.','Store visitors\' IP addresses'=>'Tọ tọju awọn adirẹsi IP ti awọn alabewo','Off: only a coded form is kept, enough for spam limits.'=>'Pa: fọ́mù tí a kó kódù nìkan ni a ń pa mọ́, ó tó fún àwọn ìwọ̀n spam.','Messages per visitor per hour'=>'Àwọn ìfiránṣẹ́ fún abẹ̀wò kọ̀ọ̀kan fún wákàtí kan','Chats per visitor per day'=>'Awọn iwiregbe lori olukuluku abẹwo ni ọjọ kan','Tickets per visitor per day'=>'Tikiiti fún alábẹ̀wò kọ̀ọ̀kan fún ọjọ́ kan','Longest chat message (characters)'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ orí ẹ̀rọ aláfọ̀wọ́sí tó gùn jù lọ (àwọn lẹ́tà)','Block list'=>'Àkójọ àwọn tí a dènà','One per line: an IP address, an email address, @domain.com, or a word.'=>'Ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan: àdírẹ́sì IP kan, àdírẹ́sì ímeèlì kan, @domain.com, tàbí ọ̀rọ̀ kan.','Where chats are answered'=>'Ibi ti a ti nsọ̀rọ̀ tàbí ohùn ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀','"This site" keeps everything in this site\'s database and uses your own AI key. "Zinn Digital®" uses the hosted inbox in the Zinn® app (for Zinn® hosting customers).'=>'"Ojula yẹn" n tọju ohun gbogbo sinu ibi ipamọ data ojula yẹn o si n lo bọọti AI tirẹ. "Zinn Digital®" n lo apoti ifiranṣẹ ti a gbalejo ninu ohun elo Zinn® (fun awọn alabara alejo gbigba Zinn®).','This site (recommended)'=>'Aaye yii (ti a ṣeduro)','Zinn Digital® app'=>'Ètò Zinn Digital®','Zinn® widget key'=>'Bọtìlì Zinn®','From the Zinn® app: Live chat, then your widget. Starts with zc_.'=>'Lati app Zinn®: Live chat, lẹhinna widget rẹ. O bẹrẹ pẹlu zc_.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Gbà aàyè fỌ̀gọ̀ntọ̀ AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Kúrò: àwọn ohun elo tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ àti àwọn ọ̀nà REST wọn kò ní ìforúkọsilẹ̀ rárá.','Zinn® Chat settings'=>'Àwọn ètò Zinn® Chat','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn eto naa.','The assistant uses your own AI key.'=>'Oluranlọ naa nlo bọtini AI tirẹ.','AI providers and models'=>'Awọn olupese ati awọn awoṣe AI','— None —'=>'— Kò sí —','Saved — leave empty to keep'=>'Tí a pamọ́ — fi sílẹ̀ ní ṣofo láti tọ́jú rẹ̀ síbẹ̀','Remove the saved key'=>'Yọ kọ́kọ́rọ́ tí a fipamọ́','Add a language'=>'Fi èdè kún un','Language code'=>'Kóòdù èdè','You are not allowed to change these settings.'=>'Ko gba ọ laaye lati yi awọn eto wọnyi pada.','Turn the chat on'=>'Tan iwiregbe naa si tan','The chat is showing on your site.'=>'Ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ náà hàn lórí ojú ojuami rẹ.','Nothing is shown or loaded on your site until you turn it on.'=>'Kò sí ohun tí a fi hàn tàbí gbé sori aaye ayelujara rẹ titi ti o fi tan an.','Turn off'=>'Pa','Turn on'=>'Tan an','Connect your AI provider'=>'So pọ̀ mọ́ olùpèsè AI rẹ','Connected. Site search uses %1$s (%2$s).'=>'Wọ́n ti sopọ̀. Ìwádìí ojú-wọ́bù ń lò %1$s (%2$s).','Connected. Your provider cannot build a meaning-based index, so the assistant uses keyword search. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key for better answers.'=>'Ti sopọ. Olupese rẹ ko le kọ atọka ti o da lori itumo, nitorina oluranlọwọ nlo wiwa oro-akọkọ. Fi bọtini Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tabi OpenRouter kun fun awọn idahun ti o dara julọ.','Add a key for Google Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Mistral, OpenRouter or any OpenAI-compatible service. The newest model is chosen for you; you can change it.'=>'Fi kọkọ fún Google Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Mistral, OpenRouter tabi eyikeyi iṣẹ to ni ibamu pẹlu OpenAI. A yàn awoṣe tuntun fun ọ; o le yipada.','AI providers'=>'Àwọn olùpèsè AI','Let the assistant read your site'=>'Jẹ́ kí olùrànlọ́wọ́ náà ka ojú-wẹ́bù rẹ','%1$d pages read, %2$d waiting, %3$d passages. New and edited content is picked up automatically.'=>'Awọn oju-iwe %1$d ti ka, %2$d n duro, %3$d awọn apakan. A n gbe akoonu tuntun ati eyiti a ti tunṣe soke laifọwọyi.','Read the whole site now'=>'Ka gbogbo aaye naa ni bayi','Create your support page'=>'Ṣẹda oju-iwe atilẹyin rẹ','Visitors submit tickets there, and ticket emails link to it.'=>'Àwọn alábèdé ń fi tikẹ́tì síbẹ̀, àwọn ìfiránṣẹ́ ímeèlì tikẹ́tì sì ń sopọ̀ mọ́ ọn.','A page with the ticket form, where customers also follow their requests.'=>'Ojú-ewé kan pẹlu fọọmu tikẹti, ibi ti awọn alabara tun ti tẹle awọn ibeere wọn.','View'=>'Wo','Create the support page'=>'Ṣẹ́ ojúewé ìtìlẹ́yìn náà','Add "Submit a ticket" and "Chat with us" to a menu'=>'Fi "Fi tikẹti silẹ" ati "Ṣe ìtumọ̀ pẹlu wa" kún ojú ìwé àṣàyàn kan','Appearance, Menus: use the Zinn® Chat box. Or add the Zinn® Chat blocks to any page, in any page builder.'=>'Àwòrán, àwọn àkójọ aṣàyàn: lo àpótí Zinn® Chat. Tàbí fi àwọn àkójọ Zinn® Chat kún ojú ewé èyíkéyìí, nípasẹ̀ olùkọ́ ojú ewé èyíkéyìí.','Menus'=>'Àwọn àkójọ aṣàyàn','WooCommerce account area'=>'Agbègbè àkántì WooCommerce','Customers see their tickets under Support in My Account, and the assistant can tell them where their order is.'=>'Àwọn oníbàárà rí àwọn tíketì wọn lábẹ́ Àtìlẹyín ní Ojúùwé mi, olùrànlọ́wọ́ náà sì lè sọ fún wọn níbi tí ìbéèrè ọjà wọn wà.','Test the assistant'=>'Dán olùrànlọ́wọ́ wò','Ask it questions and see exactly which pages it answered from, including out-of-date ones.'=>'Fi awọn ibeere le e, ki o si wo deede iru awọn oju-iwe ti o dahun lati inu rẹ, pẹlu awọn ti o ti the ti pẹ.','Open the test console'=>'Ṣí aṣọ ìṣàwòrí àdánwò náà','Answer live chats'=>'Dahun awọn iwiregbe taara lori afẹfẹ','Visitors can ask for a person while you have the Inbox open. It works on a phone too.'=>'Àwọn alábàábẹ́wẹ́ lè béèrè fún èèyàn kan nígbà tí o bá ní Inbox sílẹ̀. Ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí fóònù pẹ̀lú.','Open the Inbox'=>'Ṣí Apapọ̀ Ìfiránṣẹ́','Set up Zinn® Chat'=>'Ṣe eto Zinn® Chat','This site is connected to the Zinn Digital® app: chats are answered there. To run the help desk on this site instead, choose "This site" under Settings, Connect to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Ojula yii ni o ni asopọ si ohun elo Zinn Digital®: a n dahun awọn ibeere nibẹ. Lati lo tabili iranlọwọ lori ojula yii dipo, yan "Ojula yii" labẹ Eto, Sopọ si Zinn Digital®.','You are not allowed to do that.'=>'A kò gba ọ láyè láti ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀.','Unlimited agents, with a Support agent role that sees only chats and tickets'=>'Àwọn olùrànlọ́wọ́ aláìlópin, pẹ̀lu ipò olùrànlọ́wọ́ Atìlẹyìn tí ó ń rí àwọn ìtàkùn àti títìkì nìkan','Reply to tickets by email'=>'Dahun awọn tikẹti nipasẹ imeeli','Knowledge base: articles, categories, search, and a KB section in the chat'=>'Ibi ìmọ̀: àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ, àwọn ẹ̀ka, àwárí, àti apá kan fún ìbi ìmọ̀ nínú ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀','Saved replies, business hours, priorities and SLAs'=>'Àwọn ìdáhùn tí a ti pamọ́, àkókò iṣẹ́, àwọn ohun pàtàkì àti SLAs','Suggested replies, thread summaries and auto-tagging by AI'=>'Àwọn ìdáhùn tí a dámọ̀ràn, àkótán tẹ̀lẹ́sí, àti àmì fúnrarẹ láti ọwọ́ AI','Knowledge-gap report: the questions your site could not answer'=>'Ìròyìn lórí àìní ìmọ̀: àwọn ìbéèrè tí ojú òpó wọ̀n ǹkan kò lè dáhùn','Push notifications and an installable agent app for your phone'=>'Àwọn ìkéde tí a ti tì bọ́ inú àti ohun èlò aṣojú tí a lè fi sori ẹ̀rọ fún fóònù rẹ','Proactive messages, reports, webhooks, Slack and Telegram alerts'=>'Àwọn ìfiránṣẹ́ aṣáájú, àwọn ìròyìn, àwọn webhooks, àti ìkìlọ̀ Slack àti Telegram','Zinn® Chat Pro'=>'Zinn® Chat Pro','From $%1$d a month or $%2$d a year for one site.'=>'Lati $%1$d lọ́dún tàbí $%2$d lọ́dún fún ojú òpó kan.','Try Pro free for 14 days'=>'Gbìyànjú Pro fún ọ̀fẹ́ fún ọjọ́ mẹ́rìndínlógún','See plans'=>'Wo awọn ètò','No card needed for the trial.'=>'Ko si kaadi ti o nilo fun idanwo naa.','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Àwọn tó ṣe ChatGPT. Olùrànlọ́wọ́ rere fún gbogbo nǹkan.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Àwọn tó dá Claude sílẹ̀. Wọ́n lágbára nínú kikọ̀ àti ìrònú pẹ̀lú ìṣọra.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Awọn awoṣe Gemini ti Google. Yara ati gbowolori kekere.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Ilé-iṣẹ́ AI kan ní Yúróòpù pẹ̀lú àwọn àwoṣe kíákíá, tí kò sì wọnú.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Awọn awoṣe idiyele kekere ti o dara ni kikọ ati koodu.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Bọtini kan fun awọn awoṣe lati ọpọlọpọ awọn olupese oriṣiriṣi.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Èyíkéyìí iṣẹ́ ìránṣẹ́ tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí API OpenAI, títí kan àwṣ awoṣe tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí kọmpútà tàbí sẹ̀fà rẹ.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Gbogogbo (ti a nlo nigbati kosi ohun pataki ti a teto)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kíkọ àtiíkọ̀ sílẹ̀','Translation'=>'Ìtumọ̀','Code and CSS'=>'Koodu ati CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Má bínú, a kò gbà ọ láàyè láti wọ ojúewé yìí.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Àwọn ètò wọ̀nyí ni gbogbo àfikún tí ó ń lò wọ́n pín: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ rẹ ni wọ́n ti fi ìpamọ́ pamọ́ sínú ibi ìpamọ́ dátà ojú òpó wẹ́bù yìí, wọ́n sì ń rán an sí olùpèsè tí o yàn nìkan ni — kò ní dé ọ̀dọ̀ wa rárá.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ 1 nínú 2: yan olùpèsè AI kan','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'O mu bọ bọtọ rẹ, nitorina o n sanwo taara fun olupese fun ohun ti o lo. Ko ni idaniloju? Eyikeyi ninu iwonyi n ṣiṣẹ daradara; o le ṣafikun diẹ sii nigbamii.','Next'=>'Nísinsìnyìí','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ 2 nínú 2: so %s pọ̀','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi iṣẹ OpenAI-compatible rẹ sii, ti o pari pẹlu /v1. Bọtini kan nikan ni a nilo ti iṣẹ naa ba beere fun.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Ṣí %s kí o sì wọlé (tàbí kí o ṣẹ̀dá àkọọ̀lẹ̀ ọ̀fẹ́ kan).','the %s API keys page'=>'ojú-ewé àwọn bọ́tìnnì API %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ṣẹda bọtọ titun kan ki o si daakọ rẹ̀.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Ẹ lẹ́ mọlẹ sí ìsàlẹ̀ kí ẹ sì tẹ "Fi pamọ́ kí ẹ sì dán an wò". A máa ń rán ìbéèrè kékeré kan láti ṣàyẹ̀wò pé ó ń ṣiṣẹ́.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ àwọn olùpèsè nílò ìdíwọ̀n owó díẹ̀ lórí àkántì náà kí kọ́ọ̀sì kan tó lè ṣiṣẹ́: %s.','add credit'=>'fi kun kirediti','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Yan Olupese miiran','Address'=>'Adirẹsi','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Bọtini ti a fipamọ pari pẹlu …%s — lẹẹ mọ tuntun kan lati rọpo rẹ','Key (optional)'=>'Bọtini (ti o ba fẹ)','API key'=>'Bọtínì API','Save and test'=>'Fipamọ ki o si danwo','Providers'=>'Awọn olupese','Provider'=>'Olupese','Status'=>'Ipò','Key'=>'Bọtìnnì Ìkọkọ','Get a key'=>'Gba kọ́kọ́rọ́ kan','Test'=>'Idanwo','Remove'=>'Yọ kuro','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'A fi ẹ̀yà àfikọ́ṣe tuntun pamọ́: ṣe àfikún àfikọ́ṣe yìí, tàbí kí o tún bọ́tàkì kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà wọlé.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Àì lè ṣí kókì tí a fi paḿọ́ mọ́ mọ́ (àwọn kókì ìdáabòbò aayè náà ti yipadà). Tún tẹ́ owó rẹ̀ sílẹ̀.','Not connected'=>'Ko ni asopọ','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Sopọ — ìdánwò tó kẹhin yọrí sí rere %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Idanwo ti o kẹhin kuna: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Asopọ — a ko tii dan wo','Which model to use'=>'Irú àwọn àwòṣe wo ni láti lò','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ jẹ́ àmì ìṣedúró wa fún iṣẹ́ yẹn. Àkójọ náà ní gbogbo àwọn àwòṣe tí kọ́kọ́rọ́ rẹ lè lò, tí a kà ní tààràtà láti ọwọ́ olùpèsè náà.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— A ń gbani nímọ̀ràn fún olùpèsè —','Save models'=>'Fipamọ awọn awoṣe','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Tún àwọn àkójọ àwṣẹ́ sọ títí láti ọ̀dọ̀ àwọn alpèsè','Images'=>'Àwọn àwòrán','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'So OpenAI tabi Google Gemini lati ṣe àwọn àwòrán.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Awoṣe aworan to tuntun julọ ti olupese ti o ni asopọ akọkọ —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Iwadii aaye (awọn ọmọ ti a fi sinu)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'So Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tabi OpenRouter lati kọ Atọka wiwa ti aaye rẹ.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Ìlànà ìfàsẹ́yìn tó tuntun jù lọ ti olùpèsè àkọ́kọ́ tó ní ìsopọ̀ —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Yiyipada eyi tun kọ atọka wiwa ti gbogbo ohun itanna ti o nlo.','best quality'=>'ìpèsè tó dára jùlọ','lowest cost'=>'idi an takiti julo','fastest'=>'tara julo','Add a model yourself'=>'Fi àwoṣan kun fúnra rẹ','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Njẹ aṣàwọ̀ kan jáde lónìí? Lẹ̀ ọ̀rọ̀ gangan rẹ̀ mọ́lẹ̀ láti lò ó lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀.','Model name'=>'Oríkì àpẹẹrẹ','Add model'=>'Fi àwòṣe kún un','Recommended models list'=>'Àkójọ àwọn àwòṣe tí a gbani nímọ̀ràn','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'A kò lè fọwọ́sọ́yọ̀ mọ́ àkójọ àwọn àwoṣe tí a ṣeduro rẹ̀, nitorina a kò fi àwọn àbá hàn. Tun fi afikun (plugin) naa sori ẹrọ, tabi tan awọn imudojuiwọn ojoojumọ ni isalẹ.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Atokọ ti a nlo ni a gbe jade ni %s. Imudojuiwọn plugin kọọkan n mu tuntun wa.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Ẹ tún ṣàyẹ̀wò Zinn Digital® lẹ́ẹ̀kan lọ́jọ́ kan fún àkójọ tí a sọ di tuntun.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ìbéèrè ìṣàwọlẹ̀ tí ó rọrùn nìkan ni a fi ránṣẹ́: kò sí kọ́kọ́rọ́, kò sí àdírẹ́sì ojú òpó wẹ́bù, kò sí ohunkankan nípa àkóónú rẹ̀. A tọwọ́ si àkójọ náà, a sì máa ń fojú fo àkójọ tí kò bá kọjá àyẹ̀wò ìtọwọ́sí náà.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Àyẹ̀wò kẹ́yìn %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Fi pamọ, ki o si ṣayẹwo ni bayi ti o ba tan','a newer list was installed'=>'a fi àkọ̀sílẹ̀ tuntun kan sori ẹrọ','already up to date'=>'ti ni imudojuiwọn tẹlẹ','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'igbagbogbo ti gbigba silẹ ti kuna ayewo ibuwọlu ati pe a foju kọ silẹ','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'A ko le kan Zinn Digital®; àkójọ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ yoo wa ni lílò','turned off'=>'ti a pa ni','Open'=>'Ṣii','Check their status page'=>'Ṣẹ̀wò ojú ìwé ipò wọn','Open your billing page'=>'Ṣí ojúewé ìwé-owó rẹ','Open your API keys page'=>'Ṣí ojú ewé àwọn bọ́tìnnì API rẹ','Open the AI settings'=>'Ṣí aṣàyàn AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Ma binu, a o gba ọ laaye lati ṣe bẹẹ.','Unknown provider.'=>'Olupese ti a ko mọ.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi iṣẹ rẹ sii, fún àpẹrẹ http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Ìyẹn kò jọ bẹ́ẹ̀ kí ó jẹ́ bọ́tìnnì API. Ṣàkọ̀wé rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i, láìsí àlàfo kankan.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Kọ́ ẹ̀kọ́ API rẹ̀ sínú rẹ̀ ní àkọ́kọ́.','Key removed.'=>'A ti yọ kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà kúrò.','Models saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn àwòṣe pamọ́.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Tẹ orúkọ gangan awoṣe náà sílẹ, fún àpẹẹrẹ bí àwọn akọsilẹ olùpèsè ṣe kọ ọ́.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'A fi %s kun. Yan labẹ "Which model to use".','Model removed.'=>'A ti yọ àwọṣe náà kúrò.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Àwọn ìgbékalẹ̀ ojúmọ́ ti wà ní pípa. A ń lò àtòjọ tí ó wá pẹ̀lú plọ́gìn (plugin) náà.','Checked: %s.'=>'Àyẹ̀wò: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'A ti tun àwọn àkọsílẹ àpẹrẹ ṣe.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ẹ̀kọ́ kọ́kọ́ AI rẹ ni a fi ìyípadà tuntun kan pamọ́ látọ̀dọ̀ ọ̀kan nínú àwọn plọ́gìn rẹ. Ṣe imudojuiwọn plọ́gìn yii, tabi tẹ kọ́kọ́ naa sii lẹẹkan si ninu awọn eto AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'A kò lè ṣí bọ́tìnnì AI tí o ti fi pamọ́ mọ́ (àwọn bọ́tìnnì ààbò ojú opó wẹ́bù náà yípadà). Tẹ́ ẹ sí abẹ́ àwọn ètò AI lẹ́ẹ̀kan si.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'A ò tíì ṣètò AI. Fi bọ́tìnnì kún fún olùpèsè AI kan nínú ètò AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'A kò yan àpẹẹrẹ kankan fún iṣẹ́ yìí. Yan ọ̀kan nínú àwọn ètò AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Olupese AI yẹn ko ni atilẹyin nipasẹ ẹya yii ti plugin naa.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Ko si olupese AI ti o le ṣe awọn aworan ti o ni asopọ. Fi bọtini OpenAI tabi Google Gemini kun ninu awọn eto AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Olupese AI yii ko le ṣe awọn aworan. Yan OpenAI tabi Google Gemini fun awọn aworan ni awọn eto AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Bọtìnì AI rẹ ko le lo awoṣe aworan kankan. Ṣayẹwo awọn àṣẹ bọtìnì naa pẹlu olupese, tabi yan olupese miiran fun awọn aworan.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Kò sí olùpèsè AI tí ó ní àsopọ̀ tó lè kọ́ atọ́ka wákiri kan. Fi kún bọ́tìnnì Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tàbí OpenRouter nínú àwọn ètò AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ AI rẹ kò lè lo èròjà ìsopọ̀ kankan. Ṣàyẹ̀wọ́n àwọn àṣẹ kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà pẹ̀lu olupese, tabi yan olupese miiran fun wiwa aaye.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Elétèrọ̀ AI yìí èè ń lè kọ́ tọ́kà àwárí. So pọ̀ mọ́ Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tàbí sáfíìsì mìíràn tí ó bá múrà fún àwárí sátà.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Ojula yii ko le de ọdọ iṣẹ AI rẹ. Ṣayẹwo pe o nṣiṣẹ ati pe adirẹsi rẹ le de lati ọdọ olupin wẹẹbu rẹ (iṣẹ kan lori kọnputa tirẹ ko le de lati inu aaye ti a gbalejo).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Aaye yii ko le de %s. Ṣayẹwo oju-iwe ipo wọn; ti wọn ba wa lori ayelujara, agbalejo rẹ le n dènà awọn asopọ ti n jade, tabi adirẹsi naa jẹ aṣiṣe.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s sọ pé kò sí káàdì tàbí ààyè tí ó kù nínú àkántì rẹ. Fi owó kún rẹ tàbí gbé àlà kalẹ̀ rẹ ga nínú àkántì rẹ pẹ̀lú wọn, lẹ́yìn náà tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s kò gba kọ́ọ̀sì rẹ. Ó ṣe é kí o ti kọ ọ́ sọ́nà, kí a ti sọ ọ́ di asán tàbí kí o ti parí àkókò rẹ̀. Dá kọ́ọ̀sì tuntun kan sílẹ̀ kí o sì lẹ̀ mọ́ ibi yìí.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s kọ ìbéèrè yìí fún kọ́kọ́rọ́ rẹ. Kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà le má ní ààyè sí àwṣọ̀ tàbí ẹ̀yà yìí, tàbí kí akántì rẹ nílò ìfọwọ́sọ́pọ̀.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Ko si awoṣe "%1$s" lati %2$s fun bọtọ rẹ. Yan awoṣe miiran ninu awọn eto AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Ètò rẹ %2$s kò ní àwoṣe "%1$s" nínú. Yan àwoṣe míràn ní àwọn ètò AI, tàbí ṣe igbega ètò rẹ pẹ̀lu wọn.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s nfi opin si bi kankan to yara to le fi awọn ibeere ranṣẹ. Duro fun iṣẹju kan ki o tun gbiyanju rẹ, tabi gbe opin oṣuwọn rẹ soke pẹlu wọn.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s nírírí awọn iṣoro ni akoko yii (aiṣiṣẹ tabi apọju ni apa wọn). Ko si ohun ti ko tọ si pẹlu awọn eto rẹ. Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni kiakia.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ìbéèrù AI náà kùnà fún ìdí kan tí a kò lè mọ̀. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; tí ó bá ń ṣẹlẹ̀ sí i, kàn sí àtìlẹ́yìn pẹ̀lú àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Olupese AI naa dahun ni ọna ti pḷọọgìì (plugin) yii ko le ka. Tun gbiyanju si i; ti o ba n tẹsiwaju lati ṣẹlẹ, yan awoṣe miiran tabi kan si atilẹyin.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Àṣàyàn (Tó ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ fi kọ́kọ́ ẹnì tí ń pèsè yìí pamọ́.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Bọtini rẹ ṣiṣẹ, ṣugbọn olupese naa ko ni awoṣe ọrọ kankan fun un. Fi awoṣe kan kun funrarẹ ni isalẹ.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Asopọ. %1$s dahun nipa lilo %2$s. Awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ AI rẹ ti ṣetan lati lo.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Àì gbà fún ipò olùlò rẹ láti lo AI sórí aayè yìí. Bèerè lọ́wọ́ alábòjútó kan.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ojula yii ti de opin inawo AI rẹ fun oṣu yii. Alabojuto le gbe e soke ninu awọn eto AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ojula yii ti de opin opin oṣooṣu rẹ ti awọn ibeere AI. Alabojuto kan le gbe e soke ni awọn eto AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Lilo ati iye owo','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀, àwọn ààlà, àti àwọn àṣẹ ipa wúlò fún AI tí a lò nípasẹ̀: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Àwọn iye náà jẹ́ àìnílọ́fìn, tí aṣírò wọn dá lórí owó tí a tẹ̀ jáde; àwọn ohun tí a kò mọ owó wọn sí jẹ́ òfìfo.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Oṣù yìí: %1$s àwọn ìbéèrè, nípa %2$s.','When'=>'Nígbà tí','Who'=>'Ta ni','Used for'=>'Lo fun','Model'=>'Àwòrán Ìṣẹ̀dá','Tokens in / out'=>'Àwọn àmì tó wọlé / tó jáde','About'=>'Nipa','Result'=>'Èsì','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Kò tíì sí ìbéèrè AI kankan tí a ti ṣe.','Done'=>'Ṣe tàn','Limits and permissions'=>'Àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Ìwọ̀nná inawo lóṣooṣù (dọ́là US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ láìsí ààlà. AI yóò dúró fún ìyókù oṣù náà ní kété tí iye owó tí a fẹ́ fojú di dé ibẹ̀.','Monthly request limit'=>'Àwọn ìbéèrè tí a lè béèrè fún oṣù kan','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ ní ṣofo fún àìsí ààlà.','Who may use AI'=>'Tani o le lo AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Ko kankan si silẹ lati jẹ ki gbogbo eniyan ti o le lo awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ afikun naa lo AI. Awọn oludari le lo nigbagbogbo.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Fipamọ awọn ààrọ̀ ati awọn àṣẹ','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Awon iye ati ase ti fi pamo.','Content'=>'Àkóónú','Not found.'=>'Kò sí.','%s joined the chat.'=>'%s darapọ mọ ibaraẹnisọrọ naa.','Type a reply first.'=>'Kọ idahun kan si akọkọ.','The chat has ended. Thank you for contacting us.'=>'Ìjíròrò náà ti parí. O ṣeé ṣe fún kíkàn sí wa.','You are chatting with the assistant again.'=>'O n tún 💬 pẹlu oluranlọwọ náa lẹẹkansi.','This conversation is now ticket #%d. We will reply by email.'=>'Ìjíròrò yìí ti di tikẹ́ti #%d báyìí. A óò fèsì nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì.','Type a question first.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ tẹ ìbéèrè sílẹ̀.','The whole site is being read again in the background.'=>'Gbogbo aaye naa ni a tun n ka lẹhin.','Meanings are being rebuilt in the background.'=>'A n ṣe atunkọ awọn ìtumọ̀ ní ìpìlẹ̀.','Submit a ticket form'=>'Fi fọọmu tikẹti silẹ','Heading'=>'Orí Oro','Default subject'=>'Àkòrí àìyípadà','Button text'=>'Ọrọ bọtini','Show the subject field (yes or no)'=>'Fi aaye ori-ọrọ han (bẹẹni tabi rara)','My support requests'=>'Àwọn ìbéèrè ìtìlẹ́yìn mi','Chat button'=>'Bọtìnì ìfohùnṣe','Chat with us'=>'Bá wa sọ̀rọ̀','Support'=>'Atileyin','Thank you. Your request is ticket #%d. We have emailed you a link to follow it.'=>'Ẹ ṣeé púpọ̀. Ìbéèrè rẹ jẹ́ títìtì #%d. A ti fi aṣojú ìjápọ̀ ránṣẹ́ sí e-mail rẹ láti tẹ̀lé e.','Your reply has been sent.'=>'A ti fi ìdáhùn rẹ ránṣẹ́.','If there is a request under that address, we have emailed you a new link.'=>'Ti ìbéèrè kan bá wà lábẹ́ àdírẹ́sì yẹn, a ti fi ìjápọ̀ tuntun ránṣẹ́ sí ọ nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì.','Something went wrong. Please check the form and try again.'=>'Nkan kanṣe ko tọ. Jọwọ ṣayẹwo fọọmu na ki o tun gbiyanju lẹẹkan si.','Your message could not be sent.'=>'A kò lè fi ìránṣẹ́ rẹ ránṣẹ́.','You are sending messages too quickly. Please wait a little and try again.'=>'O n fi awọn ifiranṣẹ ranṣẹ ni iyara ju. Jọwọ duro diẹ ki o tun gbiyanju lẹẹkan si.','Please agree to the privacy notice to send your request.'=>'Jọwọ gba akiyesi aṣiri naa laaye lati fi ibeere rẹ ranṣẹ.','Please complete the check to show you are not a robot.'=>'Jọwọ pari ayẹwo na lati fi han pe o kii ṣe roboti.','Sign in to see your support requests.'=>'Wọlé láti wo àwọn ìbéèrè ìtìlẹ́yìn rẹ.','Your name'=>'Oruko re','Your email'=>'Ímeeli rẹ','Subject'=>'Orí-ọrọ','Which order is this about?'=>'Èwo ni ìbéèrè yìí wà nípa rẹ̀?','Not about an order'=>'Kò ní ṣe pẹ̀lú àṣẹ kan','How can we help?'=>'Bawo ni a ṣe le ran ọ lọwọ?','Privacy policy'=>'Ètò ìpamọ́','Send request'=>'Fi ibeere ranṣẹ','All requests'=>'Gbogbo awọn ibeere','Your support requests'=>'Awọn ibeere atilẹyin rẹ','You have no support requests yet.'=>'O ko ti ní ìbéèrè ìtìlẹ́yìn kankan rárá.','Updated'=>'Ti ṣe imudojuiwọn','New request'=>'Ìbéèrè tuntun','This link has expired. Enter your email address and we will send you a new one.'=>'Ọpọlọpọ asopọ yii ti kọja akoko rẹ. Tẹ adirẹsi imeeli rẹ sii, a o si ran ọ titun kan si ọ.','This link is not valid. Enter your email address and we will send you a link to your requests.'=>'Ọna asopọ yii ko wulo. Tẹ adirẹsi imeeli rẹ sii yoo si ran ọna asopọ kan si awọn ibeere rẹ si ọ.','Email me a new link'=>'Fi ọna asopọ tuntun ranṣẹ si imeeli mi','Request #%1$d: %2$s'=>'Ìbéèrè #%1$d: %2$s','Status:'=>'Ipo:','Your reply'=>'Idahun rẹ','Send reply'=>'Fi ìdáhùn ránṣẹ́','You'=>'Ìwọ','Submit a ticket'=>'Fi tiketi silẹ','Add to Menu'=>'Fi kun Ajọ','Create the support page on the Zinn® Chat setup screen to add a "Submit a ticket" link.'=>'Ṣẹda ojú-ewé ìtìlẹ́yìn lórí ibùjoko ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ Zinn® Chat láti fi ìsopọ̀ "Firanṣẹ tikẹti kan" kún un.','[#%1$d] We have your request: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] A gba ibeere rẹ: %2$s','Thank you for contacting us. We have received your request and will reply as soon as we can.'=>'E ṣeṣẹ fún kíkàn sí wa. A ti gbọ́ ìbéèrè rẹ, a ó sì dá a lóhùn ní kété tí a bá le ṣe é.','View your request'=>'Wo ibeere rẹ','[#%1$d] New ticket: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Tiketi tuntun: %2$s','Open the ticket'=>'Ṣí tikẹ́tì náà','[#%1$d] New reply: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Ìdáhùn tuntun: %2$s','You can reply on the page below.'=>'O le dáhùn lórí ojú-ewé tí ó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí.','View and reply'=>'Wo kí o sì dáhùn','[#%1$d] Customer replied: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Onibara dahun: %2$s','A visitor is waiting in chat #%d'=>'Alejo kan n duro ninu iwiregbe #%d','A visitor asked to talk to a person and is waiting for an answer.'=>'Alejo kan beere lati ba eniyan sọrọ o si n duro de idahun.','Answer now'=>'Dahun nisisiyi','Your chat with %s'=>'Ibaṣọpọ rẹ pẹlu %s','[#%d] Your link to your request'=>'[#%d] Ọna asopọ si ibeere rẹ','Here is a new link to your request. The old one no longer works.'=>'Ọna asopọ tuntun ni yi si ibeere rẹ. Ti atijọ naa kii ṣiṣẹ mọ.','From: %s'=>'Lati: %s','a visitor'=>'àlejò kan','Zinn® Chat chats and support tickets'=>'Awọn iṣẹ iwiregqe ati tikẹti atilẹyin ti Zinn® Chat','Chats'=>'Àwọn ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀','Started'=>'Bẹrẹ','Name'=>'Orúkọ','Email'=>'Imialì','Page'=>'Ojú-ewé','Messages'=>'Àwọn ìránṣẹ́','Support tickets'=>'Àwọn tíkẹ́tì ìṣègèé','Ticket'=>'Tikiți','Opened'=>'Ti ṣí','When you use the chat or submit a support request, we store your messages, the name and email address you give us, the page you were on and a coded form of your IP address, so that we can answer you and keep a record of your request.'=>'Nígbà tí o bá lò ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ tàbí tí o fi ìbéèrè ìrànlọ́wọ́ sílẹ̀, a máa ń tọ́jú àwọn ìránṣẹ́ rẹ, orúkọ àti àdírẹ́sì ímeèlì tí o fún wa, ojú ewé tí o wà, àti ìrísí tí a kó kọ́kọ́ ti àdírẹ́sì IP rẹ, kí a lè dá a lóhùn kí a sì tọ́jú àkọsílẹ̀ ìbéèrè rẹ.','If our AI assistant answers you, your message and passages from this website are sent to the AI provider we use to produce the answer.'=>'Bí olùrànlọ́wọ́ AI wa bá dá a lóhùn, ifẹ́ rẹ àti àwọn apá láti ojú opó wẹ́bù yìí ni a ń rán sí olùpèsè AI tí a ń lò láti ṣe ìdáhùn náà.','This chat has ended.'=>'Iwon ti pari.','The chat is not available right now.'=>'Ìb ìsòrò náà kò sí ní báyìí.','Please type a message.'=>'Jọ̀ọ́ tẹ ọ̀rọ̀ ránṣẹ́.','Please agree to the privacy notice to start the chat.'=>'Jọwọ gba akiyesi ikọsilẹ laaye lati bẹrẹ ibaraẹnisọrọ naa.','You have started too many chats today. Please try again tomorrow or send us a ticket.'=>'O ti bẹrẹ awọn iwiregbe pupọ ju loni lọ. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkan si ni ọla tabi firanṣẹ tikẹti kan wa.','The chat could not be started. Please try again.'=>'A kò lè bẹ̀rẹ̀ ìjíròrò náà. Jọ̀wọ́ gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','Nobody can answer in chat right now. Leave your email address and we will reply by email.'=>'Ko si eniyan ti o le dahun ninu iwiregbe ni bayi. Fi adirẹsi imeeli rẹ silẹ a o si fesi nipasẹ imeeli.','The assistant cannot answer right now. You can ask for a person or leave us a message.'=>'Olùrànlọ́wọ́ náà kò leè dáhùn báyìí. O leè béèrè fún èèyàn tàbí kí o fi ìránṣẹ́ sí wa.','We are putting you through to a person. Please stay on this page.'=>'A n gbé ọ wọlé bá ẹnìkan. Jọ̀ọ́ dúró sori ojú ewé yii.','Tickets are not available right now.'=>'Àwọn tikẹti kò sí báyìí.','Visitor'=>'Ẹni tí ó ń bẹwò','Team'=>'Ẹgbẹ́','Chat so far:'=>'Ìjíròrò títí di báyìí:','Thank you. Your request is ticket #%d and we will reply by email.'=>'Ẹ ṣe opolopo. Ìbéèrè yín jẹ́ tíkẹ́tì #%d a ó sì dáhùn nípa imeeli.','Please enter a valid email address.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ adirẹsi imeeli ti o wulo sii.','This link is not valid.'=>'Ọna asopọ yii kii wulo.','This link has expired. We can email you a new one.'=>'Ọna asopọ yii ti pari. A le fi tuntun ranṣẹ si ọ nipasẹ imeeli.','You cannot see this ticket.'=>'O o le ri tikẹti yii.','Hi! Ask me anything about this site. I answer from its own pages, and I can put you through to a person.'=>'Ẹ ǹlọ! Béèrè ohunkohun lọ́wọ́ mi nípa ojú opó wẹ́bù yìí. Mo ń dáhùn láti inú àwọn ojú ewé tirẹ̀, mo sì lè gbé ọ sọ̀rọ̀ pẹ̀lú ènìyàn kan.','Hi! How can we help? Send us a message and we will get back to