sí ní sopọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s n beere lati lo %2$s lori aaye yii gege bi %3$s. O le se ohun ti a gba akaunti WordPress re laaye lati se nikan, ati pe o le ge asopọ re nigbakugba lati inu awon eto awon asoju AI (MCP).','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s dá ara rẹ̀ mọ̀ láti %2$s.','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s forukọsilẹ funrararẹ laifọwọyi. Tẹsiwaju nikan ti o ba bẹrẹ eyi lati %2$s.','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ kò lè lo àwọn irinṣẹ́ wọ̀nyí lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí. Béèrè lọ́wọ́ olùṣàkóso kan.','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'Lẹ́yìn tí ẹ bá dáhùn, ẹ ó padà sí %s.','Allow %s'=>'Gba %s láàyè','Do not allow'=>'Má gba láàyè','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Iye tí a nílò ti sonù tàbí ó wà ní ọ̀nà tí kò tọ́. Ṣàyẹ̀wò ìwé ìgbbewọlé agbára náà.','The site refused the request.'=>'Ojula kọ ìbéèrè náà.','Unknown tool.'=>'Irinṣẹ́ àìmọ̀.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Gba awọn oluranlọwọ AI laaye bii Claude, Cursor tabi VS Code lati ṣiṣẹ lori aaye yii fun ọ nipasẹ MCP (Model Context Protocol). Wọn wọle bi olumulo WordPress (Claude ati ChatGPT nipa fifọwọsi wọn nibi, awọn miiran pẹlu ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo) ati pe wọn le ṣe ohun ti a gba olumulo yẹn laaye lati ṣe nikan.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Àwọn olùrànlọ́wọ́ AI nílò WordPress 6.9 tàbí àwọn tí ó tẹ̀ lé e. Ṣe imudojuiwọ̀n WordPress láti lo wọn.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Adirẹsi asopọ (opin MCP)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude ati ChatGPT: wọle dipo','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'Fi àdírẹ́sì ìsopọ̀ kún gẹ́gẹ́ bí asopọ̀ àṣà nínú Claude, tàbí gẹ́gẹ́ bí ohun èlò nínú ipò olùgbélárugẹ ChatGPT. Wọ́n ń ṣí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí kí ẹ lè fọwọ́ sí wọn; kò sí ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà láti ṣe àdàkọ.','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'Àwọn àpù AI tí a so pọ̀ mọ́ àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ:','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'Awọn ohun elo AI miiran: ọrọigbaniwọle ohun elo kan','Create an application password for your user'=>'Ṣẹda ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà ìṣètò fún olùṣe rẹ','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Fi eyi kun eto MCP ti ohun elo AI rẹ, pẹlu orukọ olumulo rẹ ati ọrọ igbaniwọle yẹn:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: fi titun kann náà sí abẹ́ "servers" nínú .vscode/mcp.json, kì í ṣe abẹ́ "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Awọn irinṣẹ ti oluranlọwọ AI le lo nibi (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Itọsọna olumulo: Awọn aṣoju AI ati MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Àwọn ìwé ìtọ́nisọ́nà fún olùgbékalẹ̀: àwọn agbára, REST àti MCP','Answer this site\'s live chats and support tickets with Zinn® Chat.'=>'Dahun awọn iwiregbe laaye ati awọn tikẹti atilẹyin ti aaye yii pẹlu Zinn® Chat.','Live chats, support tickets, the AI assistant and the help desk.'=>'Àwọn ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ láàyè, àwọn tíkẹ̀tì àtìlẹ́yìn, olùrànlọ́wọ́ AI, àti ibùdó àtìlẹ́yìn.','Read the support overview'=>'Ka akotan atilẹyin náà','Returns how many tickets are in each status and how many chats are waiting for a person (and their unread messages), and whether the chat, the assistant and tickets are switched on.'=>'Ó dá iye àwọn títẹ̀kẹ́tẹ̀ tó wà ní ipò kọ̀ọ̀kan àti iye àwọn ìfiránṣẹ́ tó ń dúró de ènìyàn (àti àwọn ìfiránṣẹ́ wọn tí a kò tíì kà), àti pé bóyá ìfiránṣẹ́ náà, olùrànlọ́wọ́ àti àwọn títẹ̀kẹ́tẹ̀ ti wà ní títàn.','Read the chat settings'=>'Ka awọn eto iwiregbe','Returns every chat setting: the widget, the assistant, people and opening hours, tickets and email, the site index, privacy and spam.'=>'Ó dá gbogbo ètò ìparọ̀ tọ̀rọ̀ padà: wíjìtì náà, olùrànlọ́wọ́ náà, àwọn ènìyàn àti àkókò ìṣíṣẹ́, àwọn tíkẹ́tì àti íméìlì, àtọka ojú-wọ́ọ̀bù náà, ìpamọ́ àti ìtàǹkàlẹ̀ asán.','Change the chat settings'=>'Yi awọn eto iwiregbe padà','Changes the settings you send (settings: key to value) and keeps the rest. Each value is checked exactly as on the settings screen; get-settings lists the keys.'=>'Ó ṣe àwọn àtúnṣe sí àwọn ètò tí o fi ránṣẹ́ (àwọn ètò: kọ́kọ́rọ́ sí iye) ó sì tọ́jú àwọn tó kù. A ń yẹ̀ ìyeye kọ̀ọ̀kan wò gẹ́gẹ́ bí ó ṣe wà lórí ojú-ìwé ètò; get-settings ṣe àkójọ àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà.','There is no chat setting called %s that can be changed here.'=>'Kò sí ètò ìjíròrò kan tí a ń pè ní %s tí a lè yí padà níbí yìí.','Ask the assistant'=>'Bi oluranlowo na lere','Asks the site\'s AI assistant a question and returns its answer with every source it found.'=>'Ó béèrè ìbéèrè lọ́wọ́ olùrànlọ́wọ́ AI ojú-òpó wẹ́bù náà, ó sì ń dáhùn pẹ̀lú gbogbo orísun tí ó rí.','The question, as a visitor would ask it (up to 2,000 characters).'=>'Ìbéèrè náà, bí àlejò kan ṣe lè bi í (títí dé 2,000 lẹ́tà).','Language code of the answer, e.g. de; the site language when omitted.'=>'Koodu èdè ti ìdáhùn náà, f.e. de; èdè ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà nígbà tí a bá fò ó dá.','Read a chat'=>'Ka iwiregbe','Returns one chat\'s messages and visitor details (after: only messages newer than this id).'=>'Ó dá àwọn ìránṣẹ́ ìjíròrò kan àti àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ alábèwò padà (lẹ́yìn: àwọn ìránṣẹ́ tó tuntun ju ìdánimọ̀ yìí lọ nìkan).','Hand a chat back to the assistant'=>'Fi ìtumọ ìparọ̀ kan padà sí olùrànlọ́wọ́','Returns a chat to the AI assistant, which answers the visitor from the site\'s content.'=>'Ó dá ìbéèrèpadà sí olùrànlọ́wọ́ AI, èyí tí ó ń dáhùn sí àwọn alábèwò láti inú àkóónú ojú-wọ̀ọ̀sùn náà.','Close a chat'=>'Pa iwiregbe kan de','Ends a chat; the visitor can still ask for the transcript.'=>'Ó parí ìfohùnsọ̀rọ̀ náà; àlejò náà ṣì lè béèrè fún ìwé ìkọ̀wé náà.','Reply in a chat'=>'Fahun ni inu chat kan','Sends a message to the visitor (text), or adds an internal note only agents see (note: true).'=>'O fi ifiranṣẹ ranṣẹ si alejo naa (text), tabi o fi akọsilẹ abẹnu kun ti awọn aṣoju nikan ni o ri (note: true).','Take a chat'=>'Bẹrẹ ìjíròrò','Assigns a waiting chat to the signed-in agent, so the visitor talks to a person.'=>'Fi ìfiránṣẹ́ tí ń dúró de sínú aṣojú tí ó ti wọlé, kí alábẹwò náà lè bá ènìyàn sọ̀rọ̀.','Turn a chat into a ticket'=>'Sọ ìjíròrò di tìkẹ́tì','Opens a ticket from a chat so it can be answered by email (needs the visitor\'s email address).'=>'Ó ṣí tícẹ̀tì kan láti inú ìjíròrò kan kí ó lè jẹ́ kí wọ́n dá a lóhùn nípasẹ̀ íméìlì (ó nílò àbá adirẹ́ẹ̀sì íméìlì alábẹ̀wò náà).','List live chats'=>'Ṣe àkọsọ àwọn ìtura tààrà','Lists the chats waiting, in progress and recently closed, with who is handling each.'=>'Ṣe àkójọ àwọn ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ tí ń dúró, tí ń lọ lọ́wọ́ àti èyí tí a tì láìpẹ́, pẹ̀lú ẹni tí ń bójútó kọ̀ọ̀kan.','Which chats: active (default), with the AI assistant, closed, or all.'=>'Awọn ibaraẹnisọrọ wo: ti n ṣiṣẹ lọwọ (aiyipada), pẹlu oluranlọwọ AI, ti a ti pa, tabi gbogbo wọn.','List what the assistant knows'=>'Ṣe àkọsọ ohun tí olùrànlọ́wọ́ mọ̀','Lists the content the assistant answers from, with its index status, a page at a time.'=>'Ó ṣe àkọsílẹ àwọn ohun tí olùrànlọ́wọ́ náà ń dáhùn láti ara wọn, pẹ̀lú ipò àfikún wọn, ojú ewé kan ní àkókò kan.','Words in the title or URL.'=>'Awọn ọrọ ninu akọle tabi URL.','Only items in this state; every state when omitted.'=>'Awọn ohun kan ni ipo yii nikan; gbogbo ipo nigbati a ba yọ kuro.','Page number, from 1.'=>'Nọ́mbà ojú-ewé, láti 1.','Rebuild the assistant\'s search index'=>'Tún àkójọ ìwádìí olùrànlọ́wọ́ ṣe','Rebuilds the search vectors for one item (item_id) or everything (all: true) (managers only).'=>'Ó tún kọ́ àwọn fẹ̀tọ̀ wíwá fún ohun kan (item_id) tàbí ohun gbogbo (all: true) (fún àwọn alákòóso nìkan).','True: every indexed item; otherwise only item_id.'=>'Otitọ: gbogbo nkan ti a ṣe atọka; bibẹẹkọ item_id nikan.','ID of one indexed item.'=>'ID ti nkan kan tí a tò sori àtòjọ.','Re-read content into the assistant'=>'Ka àwọn ohun inú tún sínú olùrànlọ́wọ́','Re-reads one item (item_id) or everything (all: true) into the assistant\'s index (managers only).'=>'Tun ka ohun kan kan (item_id) tabi ohun gbogbo (all: true) sinu atọka oluranlọwọ (awọn olutọju nikan).','True: the whole site; otherwise only item_id.'=>'True: gbogbo ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà; bí bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́ item_id nìkan.','Set your availability'=>'Ṣe ààyè rẹ','Marks the signed-in agent available or away for new chats (away: true or false).'=>'Ó sàm aṣojú tí ó ti wọlé gẹ́gẹ́ bí ẹni tó wà lórí afẹ́fẹ́ tàbí ẹni tó lọ fún àwọn ìfiránṣẹ́ tuntun (away: true tàbí false).','True marks the agent away; False (default) available.'=>'True ń fi àmì sí aṣojú bí ẹni tí kò sí níbẹ̀; False (àkùkọ) bí ẹni tí ó wà lárọ̀ọ́wọ́tó.','List tickets'=>'Àkọsọ àwọn tíketì','Lists support tickets, filtered by status or a search, a page at a time.'=>'Ó ṣe àkọsílẹ àwọn tikẹti ìṣòro, tí a yọ kúrò nípa ipò tàbí wárí, ojú pẹ̀lú ojú kan.','Which tickets: active (open and pending, the default), one status, or all.'=>'Awọn tiketi wo: ti n ṣiṣẹ (ṣiṣi ati ni idaduro, aiyipada), ipo kan, tabi gbogbo wọn.','Words in the subject, the customer\'s name or email.'=>'Awọn ọrọ ninu koko-ọrọ, orukọ onibara tabi imeeli.','Open a ticket'=>'Ṣí títìkì kan','Opens a ticket on a customer\'s behalf (their email, a subject and the first message).'=>'Ó ṣí tíkẹ́tì fún oníbàárára (ímeìlì rẹ̀, àkòrí àti ìránṣẹ́ àkọ́kọ́).','The customer\'s email address; replies go there.'=>'Adirẹsi imeeli onibara; awọn idahun yoo lọ sibẹ.','The ticket subject.'=>'Kókó ọ̀rọ̀ tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì náà.','The first message of the ticket.'=>'Ifiranṣẹ akọkọ ti tikẹti naa.','The customer\'s name.'=>'Orukọ onibara.','Delete a ticket'=>'Pa tikẹti rẹ́','Deletes a ticket and its conversation for good (managers only).'=>'Yoo pa tikẹẹti kan ati ibaraẹnisọrọ rẹ rẹ titi lai (fun awọn oludari nikan).','Read a ticket'=>'Ka tiketi kan','Returns one ticket with its whole conversation, status, priority and assignee.'=>'Ó dá tikẹti kan padà pẹ̀lú gbogbo ìjíròrò rẹ̀, ipò rẹ̀, pàtàkì rẹ̀, àti ẹni tí a yàn sí i.','Answer a ticket'=>'Dáhùn tikẹ́tì náà','Replies to the customer by email (text), or adds an internal note (note: true); status optionally changes the ticket\'s status.'=>'O n ṣe àfikún ìdáhùn sí oníbàárà nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì (text), tàbí ó fi àkọsílẹ̀ inú kún un (note: true); ipò náà le yí ìpò tikẹ́tì náà padà nípa ìfẹ́.','Change a ticket'=>'Yi tiketi pada','Changes a ticket\'s status, priority or assignee.'=>'Yiyipada ipo, àkókò tàbí ẹni tí a yàn fún tikẹ́tì náà.','List saved replies (Pro)'=>'Ṣe àkọsọ awọn ìdáhùn tí a fipamọ́ (Pro)','Lists the saved replies agents can insert, with their shortcuts.'=>'Ó ṣe àkójọ àwọn ìdáhùn tí a ti fi pamọ́ tí àwọn aṣojú lè fi sí abẹ́, pẹ̀lú àwọn ọ̀nà àbájáde wọn.','Save a saved reply (Pro)'=>'Fi ìdáhùn tí a fipamọ́ pamọ́ (Pro)','Creates or changes a saved reply (title, shortcut, body, department; id to change one).'=>'Ó ń dá tàbí ó ń pa ìdáhùn tí a ti fi pamọ́ dà (àkọlé, ọ̀nà àbájọ, ara, ẹ̀ka; id láti yí ọ̀kan padà).','ID of the saved reply to change; a new one when omitted.'=>'ID ti èsì tí a fi pamọ́ láti yípadà; tuntun kan nígbà tí a bá fò ó dá.','The saved reply\'s title.'=>'Àkọlé ìdáhùn tí a fipamọ́.','The reply text.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ èsì náà.','Short code agents type to insert it (letters, digits, - and _).'=>'Koodu kukuru ti awon asoju ma n te lati fi sii (awon leta, nomba, - ati _).','Department it belongs to; every department when empty.'=>'Ẹka ti o wa ninu rẹ; gbogbo ẹka nigbati o ba ṣofo.','Delete a saved reply (Pro)'=>'Pa ìdáhùn tí a fi pamọ́ rẹ́ (Pro)','Deletes a saved reply.'=>'Ó pa ìdáhùn tí a fi pamọ́ rẹ́.','Fill in a saved reply (Pro)'=>'Fi esi ti a fipamọ kun (Pro)','Returns a saved reply\'s text with its placeholders filled for one chat or ticket.'=>'Ó dá ọ̀rọ̀ ìdáhùn tí a fipamọ́ padà pẹ̀lú àwọn ibi tí a ti kọ̀ sí tí ó kún fún ìdánimọ̀ kan fún ìjíròrò tàbí tíkẹ́tì kan.','Set a conversation\'s department and tags (Pro)'=>'Ṣe ìpín àti àwọn tágì fún ìjíròrò kan (Pro)','Sets the department and tags of a chat or ticket (kind: chat or ticket; id).'=>'Ó Ṣètò ẹ̀ka àti àwọn tágì ti ìjíròrò tàbí tíkẹ́tì (irú: ìjíròrò tàbí tíkẹ́tì; ìdánimọ̀).','Whether id is a ticket (default) or a chat.'=>'Boya id jẹ tiketi (aiyipada) tabi iwiregbe kan.','ID of the ticket or chat.'=>'ID ti tikẹti tabi ifọrọwerọ.','Department name; empty clears it.'=>'Orukọ ẹka; fifi silẹ ni ofifo yoo pa a rẹ.','Tags, replacing the current ones.'=>'Àwọn àlẹ̀mọ́, tí ń rọ́pò àwọn tí ó wà lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́.','List unanswered questions (Pro)'=>'Fi àwọn ìbéèrè tí a kò tíì dáhùn hàn (Pro)','Lists the questions visitors asked that the knowledge base could not answer.'=>'Ó ṣe àkọsọ awọn ibeere ti awọn abẹwo bi ti ipilẹ imọ ko le dahun.','Which gaps: open (default), drafted, answered, ignored or all.'=>'Awọn aafo wo: ṣiṣi (aiyipada), ti a kọ silẹ, ti a dahun, ti a foju fo tabi gbogbo wọn.','Draft help articles for unanswered questions (Pro)'=>'Kọ àwọn àpilẹkọ ìrànlọwọ fún àwọn ìbéèrè tí a kò tíì dáhùn (Pro)','Writes draft knowledge-base articles answering the chosen questions (ids); they stay drafts.'=>'Ó kọ àwọn àpilẹ́kọ ibi ìmọ̀ (knowledge-base) tí ó jẹ́ àkọpamọ́ tí ó sì ń dáhùn àwọn ìbéèrè tí a yàn (ids); wọn yoo wa bi akopamo.','IDs of the knowledge gaps to cover in one draft.'=>'Awọn ID ti awọn aafo imo lati bo ninu iwe afọwọkọ kan.','Mark unanswered questions (Pro)'=>'Samisi awọn ibi ti a ko tii dahun (Pro)','Marks unanswered questions as open, planned or dismissed (ids, status).'=>'O ṣe àmì sí àwọn ìbéèrè tí a kò tíì dáhùn gẹ́gẹ́ bíi èyí tí ó sílẹ̀, èyí tí a sètò, tàbí èyí tí a kọ̀ sílẹ̀ (àwọn ìdánimọ̀, ipò).','IDs of the knowledge gaps.'=>'Àwọn ID ti àwọn àlàfo ìmọ̀.','The new state of the gaps.'=>'Ipò tuntun ti àwọn àlàfo náà.','Draft a help article from a ticket (Pro)'=>'Ko àpilẹkọ ìrànlọwọ kan láti inú títẹ́kìtì (Pro)','Writes a draft knowledge-base article from a solved ticket; it stays a draft until a person publishes it.'=>'Ó kọ àpilẹ̀kọ ìpìlẹ̀ ìmọ̀ ìpìlẹ̀ kan láti inú títì tí a ti yanju; ó wà gẹ́gẹ́ bí àpilẹ̀kọ fún ìgbà díẹ̀ títí tí ẹnì kan yóò fi tẹ̀ ẹ́ jáde.','ID of the solved ticket the article is drafted from.'=>'ID ti tikẹti ti a yanju ti a fi kọ àkọsílẹ àpilẹ̀kọ náà.','Search the knowledge base (Pro)'=>'Wá ibi ìmọ̀ ìpìlẹ̀ (Pro) lọ','Finds help articles to link in a reply (q: the search).'=>'Wa awọn nkan iranlọwọ lati sopọ ninu esi (q: wiwa naa).','Words to search the help articles for.'=>'Awọn ọrọ lati wa awọn àpilẹ̀kọ iranlọwọ.','Read support statistics (Pro)'=>'Ka àwọn ìsọfìtì ìtìlẹ́yìn (Pro)','Returns chat and ticket numbers, response times and ratings for the last N days (days).'=>'Ó máa ń dá ìfiránṣẹ́ àti àwọn nọ́mbà tíkẹ́tì padà, àkókò ìdáhùn àti àwọn ìwọ̀n fún ọjọ́ N (àwọn ọjọ́) tó kọjá.','How many days back the report covers; 30 when omitted.'=>'Ọjọ́ mélòó sẹ́yìn ni ìròyìn náà kárí; 30 nígbà tí a bá fo.','Draft a reply with AI (Pro)'=>'Kọ ìdáhùn kan pẹ̀lú AI (Pro)','Drafts a reply to a chat or ticket from the site\'s content; nothing is sent.'=>'Ó ṣe àkọọ́lẹ̀ ìdáhùn kan sí ìjíròrò tàbí tíkẹ́tì láti inú àkóónú ojú-wọ̀ọ̀sù; kò sí ohun tí a rán.','Summarise a conversation with AI (Pro)'=>'Akopọ ibaraẹnisọrọ pẹlu AI (Pro)','Summarises a chat or ticket in a few lines.'=>'Ó ṣe àkópọ̀ ìjíròrò tàbí tíkẹ́tì náà ní ìlà díẹ̀.','Change many tickets at once (Pro)'=>'Yi ọpọlọpọ tikẹeti pada lẹẹkan kan (Pro)','Changes the status, priority or assignee of up to 100 tickets (ids). Each ticket goes through the same checks as changing it on its own; the result lists each one.'=>'Ó ń yí ipò, ìpele pàtàkì tàbí ẹni tí a yàn sí i padà fún tó àwọn tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì (ids) 100. Tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì kọ̀ọ̀kan ń gba àwọn àyẹ̀wò kan náà bíi gbígbé e yípadà fúnra rẹ̀; àbájáde rẹ̀ ń ṣe àkójọ ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan wọn.','Write a help article (Pro)'=>'Kọ àpilẹ̀kọ ìrànlọ́wọ́ kan (Pro)','Creates a knowledge-base article, or changes one (id): title, content, excerpt, categories and status (draft, or publish when you may publish).'=>'Ó ń ṣẹ̀dá àpilẹ̀kọ àpótí-ìmọ̀ kan, tàbí kí ó ṣe àtúnṣe sí ọ̀kan (id): àkọlé, àkóónú, àfàyọ, àwọn ẹ̀ka àti ipò (àkọsílẹ̀-àkọ́kọ́, tàbí tẹ̀jáde nígbà tí ẹ bá ní ẹ̀tọ́ láti tẹ̀jáde).','Say what to change: status, priority or assignee_id.'=>'Sọ ohun tí ó yẹ kí a yípadà: ipò (status), ìṣáájú (priority) tàbí olùpínṣẹ́ (assignee_id).','A new article needs a title.'=>'Ojò kan nínú àpilẹ̀kọ tuntun nílò àkọlé kan.','Support agent'=>'Olùṣọ̀ tìlẹ́yìn','Invitation sent. The new agent sets a password from the email and lands in the Inbox.'=>'A ti rán ìpè náà sí. Aṣojú tuntun náà ṣètọ̀ ankọ̀ (password) láti inú ímeèlì náà ó sì dé inú Àpótí Ìfọ̀rọ̀ránṣẹ́ (Inbox).','Saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ.','Support agents answer chats and tickets and use saved replies. They cannot open any other part of wp-admin. Managers (administrators) also change settings.'=>'Awọn aṣoju ìtìlẹyìn n dahun ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ àti àwọn tikẹti wọ́n sì n lo àwọn ìdáhùn tí a fipamọ́. Wọn kò lè ṣí èyíkéyìí apá miiran ninu wp-admin. Àwọn alábòjútó (àwọn alábòjútó) tún n yí àwọn ètò padà.','Role'=>'Ipá','Departments'=>'Àwọn Ẹka','Manager'=>'Alákóso','No departments yet (Settings, Team and routing).'=>'Ko si awọn ẹka kankan sibẹsibẹ (Eto, Ẹgbẹ ati ipa ọna).','Remove from the team'=>'Kúrò nínú ẹgbẹ́ náà','Save departments'=>'Fipamọ awọn ẹ̀ka-iṣẹ́','Invite an agent'=>'Pe oluranlọwọ kan','If this person already has an account on the site, it is given the Support agent role instead (their other roles are kept).'=>'Bi eniyan yii ba ti ni akọọlẹ tẹlẹ lori aaye naa, a fun ni ipa aṣoju Atilẹyin dipo (a tọju awọn ipa miiran rẹ).','Send invitation'=>'Fi ifiwepe ranṣẹ','That account can already manage the help desk.'=>'Àkọọlẹ yẹn ti le ṣàkóso ibùdó ìrànlọwọ náà tẹ́lẹ̀.','That did not work. Please try again.'=>'Ìyẹn kò ṣiṣẹ́. Jọ̀wọ́ gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan si.','You are not allowed to change the team.'=>'Ko gba ọ laaye lati yi ẹgbẹ naa pada.','Department'=>'Ẹka','— Choose —'=>'— Yan —','Nothing to answer yet.'=>'Kò sí ohun tí a lè dáhùn sí báyìí.','The AI could not draft a reply.'=>'AI náà kò lè kọ ìdáhùn kan.','The AI could not summarise this.'=>'AI naa ko le ṣe akopọ eyi.','The AI could not draft an article.'=>'AI ko le kọ àpilẹ̀kọ kan.','The AI answered in an unexpected shape. Please try again.'=>'Oye ti AI ko ri bi o ti ye. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkan si.','Saved replies'=>'Awọn idahun ti a fipamọ','A saved reply needs a title and some text.'=>'Ìdáhùn tí a fi pamọ́ nílò àkọlé àti àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ kan.','The sitemap could not be read.'=>'A kò le ka maapu aaye naa (sitemap).','The page could not be read.'=>'A kò le ka ojú-ewé náà.','Very poor'=>'Kò dáa rárá','Poor'=>'Ko lẹ́sẹ̀ ǹkan','OK'=>'O DARA','Good'=>'Dára','Excellent'=>'O dara julọ','[#%1$d] How did we do? %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Bawo ni a ṣe ṣe? %2$s','We marked your request as solved. How happy are you with the help you got?'=>'A ṣe àmì sí ìbéèrè rẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí èyí tí a ti yanjú. Báwo ni inú rẹ̀ ṣe dùn tó sí ìrànlọ́wọ́ tí o gba?','One click is enough. If something is still wrong, just reply to your request and it opens again.'=>'Tẹ kan ti o ba to. Tẹ́ẹ̀ bá ní ohun kan tí kò tọ́ sí i, fi èsì sí ìbéèrè rẹ, yóò sì tún ṣí sílẹ̀.','This rating link is not valid any more. Thank you all the same.'=>'Ọpọlọpọ igbelewọn yii kii ṣe wulo mọ. Síbẹ̀síbẹ̀, a dupẹ lọwọ rẹ.','Thank you. Your comment has been passed to the team.'=>'Ẹ ṣe jọọ. A ti gba asọye rẹ si ọwọ́ àwọn olùṣètò náà.','How happy are you with the help you got?'=>'Báwo ni inú rẹ ṣe dùn tó sí ìrànlọwọ́ tí o gbà?','Anything you would like to tell us? (optional)'=>'Se ohunkohun wa ti o fẹ sọ fún wa? (ti ko dandan)','Thank you for your rating.'=>'Ẹ ṣe olùpín fún ìwọ̀n rẹ.','Back to the site'=>'Padà sí ojú-wọ́ wẹ́bù náà','The knowledge base is switched off.'=>'A ti pa ìpìlẹ̀ ìmọ̀ rẹ̀.','Knowledge gaps'=>'Awọn oju ti o ku ninu imọ','Nothing selected.'=>'Kò sí ohun tí a yàn.','%1$s We are back %2$s.'=>'%1$s A ti pada wa %2$s.','First reply'=>'Ìdáhùn àkọ́kọ́','Reply to this email to answer.'=>'Dáhùn sí ímeèlì yìí láti fèsì.','Email from %s (not the customer on this ticket):'=>'Imeli láti ọ̀dọ̀ %s (kìí ṣe oníbàárà tó wà lórí tíkẹ́tì yìí):','%d email read.'=>'%d imeeli ti a ka.','Import a knowledge base'=>'Gbe ipilẹ imọ wọle','Import'=>'Gbe wọle','KB import'=>'Wọ́n gbe KB wọlé','Last import: %1$d articles, %2$d categories. %3$s'=>'Ìgbékọ̀ lẹ́yìn ìgbẹ̀yìn: %1$d àpilẹ̀kọ, %2$d ẹ̀ka. %3$s','Finished.'=>'Ó parí.','Still running in the background: reload to see progress.'=>'Ṣì ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́ lẹ́yìn: tún gbé e wọlé láti rí ìtẹ̀síwájú náà.','Copies articles and categories from another knowledge base on this site into the Zinn® Chat knowledge base, keeping the category tree, the order, the slugs and the content. Old addresses redirect to the new ones. Running it again updates instead of duplicating.'=>'Ó má da àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ àti àwọn ẹ̀ka láti inú ìpilẹ̀ ìmọ̀ mìíràn tó wà lórí ojú-wọ̀n yìí sínú ìpilẹ̀ ìmọ̀ Zinn® Chat, nígbà tí ó ń tọ́jú igi ẹ̀ka náà, àwọn ìtòsí, àwọn slug, àti àwọn àkóónú náà. Àwọn àdírẹ́sì àtijọ́ máa ń tún ń darí sí àwọn tuntun náà. Nípa ṣíṣe é lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i, ó máa ń ṣe àtúnṣe dípò tí yóò fi ṣe ẹ̀dọ̀gbọ̀n.','Import from'=>'Gbe wọ ti o bẹrẹ lati','%1$s (%2$d articles)'=>'%1$s (%2$d àpilẹ̀kọ)','Another post type:'=>'Irú ifiweranṣẹ miiran:','with categories from'=>'pẹ̀lú àwọn ẹ̀ka láti ọ̀dọ̀','(none)'=>'(kò sí)','The pages under this page:'=>'Àwọn ojúlé tó wà lábé ojúlé yìí:','The originals'=>'Awọn atilẹba','Set the imported originals to draft (their addresses then redirect to the new articles)'=>'Ṣe àwọn àkọ́kọ́ tí a kó wọlé sí àkọọlẹ (draft) (àwọn àdírẹ́sì wọn á ní máa darí sí àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ tuntun náà)','You are not allowed to import.'=>'A kò yọ̀ǹda fún ọ láti gbé wọlé.','yes or no'=>'bẹẹni tabi bẹẹkọ','Knowledge base home'=>'Ile ipilẹ imọ','Heading (empty: the KB title)'=>'Orí (ó ṣófo: àkọlé KB)','Only these categories (slugs or IDs, comma-separated)'=>'Awọn ẹka wọnyi nikan (awọn slug tabi ID, ti a ya sọtọ pẹlu aami àmì-ìsọ̀rọ̀)','Leave out these categories'=>'Fi awon eka wonyi sile','Columns, 1 to 4'=>'Àwọn Òpó, 1 sí 4','Articles under each category (0 for none)'=>'Àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ lábẹ́ ẹ̀ka kọ̀ọ̀kan (0 fún àìsí)','Show article counts (%s)'=>'Fi nọmba awọn àpilẹkọ han (%s)','Show the search box (%s)'=>'Fi apoti wiwa han (%s)','Knowledge base search'=>'Iwadi ibi ìmọ̀','Placeholder text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ àfikún fún ààyè','Search only this category (slug or ID)'=>'Ṣàwárí ẹ̀ka yìí nìkan (slug tàbí ID)','Show results while typing (%s)'=>'Fi abajade han nigbati o n tẹ (%s)','Knowledge base categories'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀ka ìpìlẹ̀ ìmọ̀','Only these categories (slugs or IDs)'=>'Awọn ẹka wọnyi nikan (awọn slug tabi awọn ID)','Sub-categories of (slug or ID; empty: top level)'=>'Àwọn abẹ-ẹka ti (slug tàbí ID; asán: ipele òkè)','Articles under each category'=>'Àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ lábẹ́ ẹ̀ka kọ̀ọ̀kan','Show descriptions (%s)'=>'Ṣafihan àlàyé (%s)','Order: order, name or count'=>'Àṣẹ: àṣẹ, orúkọ tàbí iye','Hide empty categories (%s)'=>'Fi awọn ẹka ti ko ni nkan pamọ (%s)','Knowledge base category'=>'Ẹka ìpìlẹ̀ ìmọ̀','Category (slug or ID; empty: the category being viewed)'=>'Ẹ̀ka (slug tàbí ID; tí kò bá ní ńkan nínú: ẹ̀ka tí a ń wò lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́)','Heading (empty: the category name)'=>'Àkọlé (ó ṣofo: orúkọ ẹ̀ka náà)','How many articles (empty: all)'=>'Ba melo ni àpilẹ̀kọ (tí ó bá jẹ́ òfo: gbogbo rẹ̀)','Order: order, title, date, modified or helpful'=>'Àṣẹ: àṣẹ, àkọlé, ọjọ́, ti a tunṣe tabi wulo','Show summaries (%s)'=>'Fi awọn akopọ han (%s)','Show sub-categories (%s)'=>'Ṣafihan àwọn ẹ̀ka-ìsàlẹ̀ (%s)','Knowledge base articles'=>'Àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ ìpìlẹ̀ ìmọ̀','From this category (slug or ID)'=>'Lati ẹka yii (slug tabi ID)','These articles (IDs, in this order)'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀kọ́ wọ̀nyí (àwọn ID, ní ìlànà yìí)','How many'=>'Elo melo','Order: date, modified, title, order or helpful'=>'Ètò: ọjọ́, àtúnṣe, àkọlé, ìbéèrè tàbí wúlè','Layout: list or grid'=>'Ètò: àtòjọ tàbí gírìdì','Grid columns, 1 to 4'=>'Àwọn òpó grid, láti 1 sí 4','Knowledge base article'=>'Àpilẹ̀kọ ìpìlẹ̀ ìmọ̀','Article ID or slug'=>'ID tabi slug nkan','Show the title (%s)'=>'Fi akọle rẹ han (%s)','Knowledge base breadcrumbs'=>'Àwọn àmì ìtọ́kasí ibùdó ìmọ̀','No articles match.'=>'Ko si nkan ti o baamu.','See all results'=>'Wo gbogbo abajade','Search the help centre…'=>'Wá aaye iranlọwọ…','Search'=>'Wáà','No categories yet.'=>'Ko ti sí ẹ̀ka kankan síbẹ̀.','%d article'=>'%d àpilẹkọ','All %d articles'=>'Gbogbo àpilẹ̀kọ %d','No articles in this category yet.'=>'Ko si awọn nkan ninu ẹka yii yet.','No articles yet.'=>'Kò sí àpilẹ̀kọ kankan báyìí.','Breadcrumb'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́kasí ojúlé','Related articles'=>'Àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ tó jọ mọ́ ẹnì kan','Help centre'=>'Gbọngan ìrànlọ́wọ́','Knowledge base'=>'Gbọngan ìmọ̀','Use the knowledge base'=>'Lo ìpìlẹ̀ ìmọ̀','Articles and categories under Zinn® Chat, Knowledge base.'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀kọ́ àti ẹ̀ka lábẹ́ Zinn® Chat, Ilé ìmọ̀.','The KB lives at your site address followed by this, for example /kb/ or /help/.'=>'KB náà wà lórí àdíẹsẹ ojú òpó wébsáìtì rẹ tí ó tẹ̀lé èyí, fún àpẹrẹ /kb/ tàbí /help/.','Title of the KB home page'=>'Oríkì ojúewé ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ KB','Layout of the KB home and category pages'=>'Ìpìlẹ̀ ojú-ewé ilé àti ẹ̀ka ti KB','Zinn® Chat layout: search, category cards and article lists'=>'Ètò Zinn® Chat: àwọn àwárí, àwọn káàdì ẹ̀ka àti àwọn àkójọ àpilẹ̀kọ','Your theme\'s archive pages'=>'Awọn oju-iwe pamosi akori rẹ','Category columns'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀ka kọlọmù','Articles listed under each category on the KB home'=>'Awọn nkan ti a ṣe akojọ labẹ ẹka kọọkan lori ile KB','Show how many articles each category has'=>'Fi iye àpilẹ̀kọ tí ẹ̀ka kọ̀ọ̀kan ní hàn','Table of contents on long articles'=>'Àkọsílẹ àwọn ohun inú lórí àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ gígùn','Ask "Was this article helpful?"'=>'Bere lọ́wọ́ "Ṣé àpilẹ̀kọ yìí wúlò?"','"No" answers appear in the Knowledge gaps report.'=>'Àwọn ìdáhùn "Bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́" hàn nínú ìjábọ̀ àwọn àlàfo ìmọ̀.','Related articles under each article'=>'Àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ tó jọmọ́ abẹ́ àpilẹ̀kọ kọ̀ọ̀kan','Structured data for search engines (Article and breadcrumbs)'=>'Àwọn dátà tó wà ní ìlànà fún àwọn ẹ̀rọ àwárí (Àpilẹ̀kọ àti àwọn àmì ojú ọ̀nà)','Left to your SEO plugin when Yoast, Rank Math, SEOPress or All in One SEO is active.'=>'Fi silẹ fun p[rogin SEO rẹ nigbati Yoast, Rank Math, SEOPress tabi All in One SEO ba nṣiṣẹ.','Show "Help articles" search in the chat window'=>'Fi "Help articles" àwárí hàn nínú fèrèsè ìjíròrò','Suggest related articles under the assistant\'s answers'=>'Daba awọn àpilẹ̀kọ tí ó ní ṣe pẹ̀lú rẹ̀ lábẹ́ àwọn ìdáhùn olùrànlọ́wọ́ náà','Write richer articles with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Fi awọn nkan ti o ni ọrọ sii kun pẹlu Page Builder Sandwich','Tabs, accordions, callouts and step lists right in the block editor. Every KB article and category page can use them.'=>'Àwọn taabu, àwọn akọnsì, àwọn àpẹẹrẹ ìpe àti àwọn àtòjọ ìgbésẹ̀ wà ní tààràtà nínú olùṣàtúnṣe bọ́ọ̀kì náà. Gbogbo àpilẹ̀kọ KB àti ojúewé ẹ̀ka le lò wọ́n.','Publish your KB in every language with Tranzly'=>'Tẹ Knowledge Base rẹ jade ni gbogbo ede pẹlu Tranzly','Articles, categories, addresses and search results translated automatically, with each language on its own address.'=>'Àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ, àwọn ẹ̀ka, àwọn àdírẹ̀sì àti àwọn èsì ìwárí ni a túmọ̀ sí àìníṣẹ́ni-lọ́wọ́, pẹ̀lú èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan lórí àdírẹ̀sì tirẹ̀.','KB categories'=>'Awọn ẹka KB','KB category'=>'Ẹka KB','Add a KB category'=>'Fi ẹ̀ka KB kún un','Edit KB category'=>'Ṣatunkọ ẹ̀ka KB','Search KB categories'=>'Wá awọn ẹ̀ka KB','Article'=>'Àpilẹ̀kọ','Add article'=>'Fi àpilẹkọ kun','Add a new article'=>'Fi àpilẹkọ tuntun kun','Edit article'=>'Ṣatunkọ nkan','New article'=>'Àpilẹ̀kọ tuntun','View article'=>'Wo nkan','Search articles'=>'Wá awọn nkan silẹ','No articles in the bin.'=>'Kò sí àpilẹ̀kọ kankan nínú apẹ̀rẹ̀ náà.','Search, categories and articles.'=>'Wíwá, àwọn ẹ̀ka, àti àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ.','One category and its articles.'=>'Ẹka kan ati awọn nkan rẹ.','Was this article helpful?'=>'Ṣe nǹkankan wúlẹ̀ fún ọ nínú àpilẹ̀kọ yìí?','On this page'=>'Lórí ojú ewé yìí','Article not helpful: %s'=>'Àpilẹ̀kọ náà kò rànǹilọ́wọ́: %s','Help articles'=>'Àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ ìrànlọ́wọ́','Search help articles…'=>'Wá awọn nkan iranlọwọ…','Popular articles'=>'Àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ tó gbajúmọ̀','No articles match. Ask us in the chat instead.'=>'Kò sí àpilẹ̀kọ tí ó bá mu. Ẹ bi wá nínú ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ dipò rẹ̀.','Browse the help centre'=>'Ṣawari ile-iṣẹ iranlọwọ','Back to the chat'=>'Pada si ibi ifọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀','A draft is ready. Check it, fill in anything marked [FILL IN], and publish it: the assistant uses it at once.'=>'Àkọọlẹ àkọ́kọ́ ti ṣetan. Ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀, kún ohunkohun tí a fi àmì sí [FILL IN], kí o sì tẹ̀ é jáde: olùrànlọ́wọ́ náà ń lò ó lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀.','Order'=>'Ètò','Lower numbers come first.'=>'Àwọn nọ́mbà tó kéré jù ló máa ń kọ́kọ́ wá.','Icon'=>'Àwòrán kékeré','A Dashicons name such as book, cart or admin-users, or one emoji.'=>'Orúkọ Dashicons kan bí i book, cart tàbí admin-users, tàbí emoji kan.','New ticket #%1$d: %2$s (from %3$s)'=>'Tiketi tuntun #%1$d: %2$s (lati ọdọ %3$s)','Customer replied on ticket #%1$d: %2$s'=>'Onibara dahun lori tiketi #%1$d: %2$s','A visitor is waiting in chat #%1$d (%2$s)'=>'Alejo kan n duro ninu iwiregbe #%1$d (%2$s)','Ticket #%1$d missed its first-reply target: %2$s'=>'Tikẹẹti #%1$d padanu ibi-afẹde idahun akọkọ rẹ: %2$s','Ticket #%1$d missed its resolution target: %2$s'=>'Tiketi #%1$d ti kọja ibi-afẹde ipinnu rẹ: %2$s','Team and routing'=>'Ẹgbẹ ati ipa ọna','Hours and SLAs'=>'Awọn wakati ati awọn SLA','Email replies'=>'Àwọn ìdáhùn ímeèlì','Alerts and webhooks'=>'Awọn iwifunni ati awọn webhooks','Proactive messages'=>'Àwọn ìránṣẹ́ alápamọ́','Branding'=>'Ìṣàmì ilé-iṣẹ́','One per line, for example: Sales. Agents are placed in departments on the Team screen.'=>'Ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan, fún àpẹrẹ: Sales. A gbe awọn aṣoju si awọn ẹka loju iboju Team.','Let customers choose a department on the ticket form'=>'Jẹ ki awọn onibara yan ẹka kan lori fọọmu tikẹti naa','Assign new tickets'=>'Fi àwọn tikẹti tuntun to fúnni','Only agents in the ticket\'s department are chosen when it has one.'=>'Awọn aṣoju nikan ti o wa ni ẹka tikẹti naa ni a yan nigbati o ni ọkan.','Do not assign (the first agent to reply takes it)'=>'Má ṣe fi iṣẹ́ náà lé ẹni kan lọ́wọ́ (aṣojú àkọ́kọ́ tó bá fèsì ni yóò mú u)','In turn (round robin)'=>'Nípa ìyípadà (round robin)','To the agent with the fewest open tickets'=>'Sí aṣoju pẹ̀lú àwọn tikẹti tí ó sílẹ̀ jùlọ lọ','Use business hours'=>'Lo awọn wakati iṣẹ','Outside these hours "Talk to a person" is not offered, the chat says when you are back, and visitors can leave a message.'=>'Lẹhin awọn wakati wọnyi "Sọrọ si eniyan" ko ni aṣayan, iwiregbe naa sọ nigbati o ba pada, ati pe awọn alejo le fi ifiranṣẹ silẹ.','Time zone'=>'Agbègbè àkókò','For example Europe/London. Empty: the site\'s time zone.'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ Europe/London. Òfo: agbègbè àkókò ojú òpó wẹ́bù náà.','For example 09:00-17:00, or 09:00-12:30, 13:30-17:00. Empty: closed.'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ 09:00-17:00, tàbí 09:00-12:30, 13:30-17:00. Òfo: ti ni ìpínlẹ̀.','Closed on these dates'=>'Ti a ti sé ni awọn ọjọ wọnyi','One date per line, as YYYY-MM-DD.'=>'Ọjọ́ kan ní gbogbo ìlà, gẹ́gẹ́ bí YYYY-MM-DD.','Track response and resolution targets (SLAs)'=>'Tọpa idahun ati awọn àfojúsùn ìdáhùn (SLAs)','Tickets show how long is left, and the team is alerted when a target is missed.'=>'Àwọn títíkè fi hàn bí àkókò tó kù sí i, wọ́n sì ń sọ fún ẹgbẹ́ náà nígbà tí a bá padánù àfojúsùn kan.','Count only business hours toward the targets'=>'Ka àwọn wákàtì iṣẹ́ nìkan sí àwọn àfojúsùn náà','Let the AI set the priority of new tickets from their urgency'=>'Jẹ ki AI ṣeto ayo ti awọn tikẹti titun lati inu iyara wọn','First reply within (hours), %s'=>'Idahun akọkọ laarin (awọn wakati), %s','Solved within (hours), %s'=>'Gbà wọlé láàárín (àwọn wákàtí), %s','Customers reply to ticket emails'=>'Awọn alabara n dahun si awọn imeeli tikẹti','Their reply is added to the ticket, and the team is told.'=>'A fi ìdáhùn wọn kún títìkì náà, a sì sọ fún ẹgbẹ́ náà.','Off (they reply on the ticket page)'=>'Pa (wọn dahun lori oju-iwe tikẹti naa)','Read a mailbox (IMAP)'=>'Ka apoti ifiranṣẹ (IMAP)','An email service forwards messages to this site (webhook)'=>'Iṣẹ imeeli kan n gbe awọn ifiranṣẹ ranṣẹ si aaye yii (webhook)','Support email address'=>'Adirẹsi imeeli atilẹyin','Replies go to this address. It must be the mailbox read below, or the address your email service forwards.'=>'Awọn ìdáhùn lọ sí àdíréẹ̀sì yìí. Ó gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ apótí ìfiwéránṣẹ́ tí a kà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí, tàbí àdíréẹ̀sì tí iṣẹ́ ìfiwéránṣẹ́ rẹ ń gbé lọ.','Use plus addresses (support+123@…) so each reply finds its ticket'=>'Lo awọn adirẹsi plus (support+123@…) ki esi kọọkan le ri tikẹti rẹ','Only if your mailbox accepts them; the ticket number in the subject works too.'=>'Nikan ti apoti ifiranṣẹ rẹ ba gba wọn; nọmba tikẹti ti o wa ninu akọle naa tun nṣiṣẹ.','Open a new ticket for other emails to the support address'=>'Ṣí tíkẹ́́tì tuntun fún àwọn imeèlì mìíràn sí àdírẹ́sì ìtìlẹ́yìn','IMAP server'=>'Olùpèsè ìránṣẹ́ IMAP','For example imap.gmail.com.'=>'Fun apẹẹrẹ imap.gmail.com.','IMAP port'=>'Ibudo IMAP','IMAP security'=>'Ààbò IMAP','IMAP user name'=>'Orúkọ olùṣe ìtumọ̀ IMAP','IMAP password'=>'Ọrọ anina IMAP','An app password where your provider offers one.'=>'Ọrọigbaniwọle ohun elo kan nibiti olupese rẹ nfunni ni ọkan.','Send alerts for'=>'Fi awọn ifitonileti ranṣẹ fun','New tickets'=>'Awọn tikẹti titun','Customer replies'=>'Àwọn ìdáhùn oníbàárà','Visitors waiting in chat'=>'Àwọn àlejò tó ń dúró nínú ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀','Missed SLA targets'=>'Àwọn àfojúsùn SLA tí ó bọ́ sílẹ̀','Push notifications to the agents\' phones and computers'=>'Fi awọn iwifunni ranṣẹ si awọn foonu ati awọn kọmputa awọn aṣoju','Each agent turns them on in the Inbox, on each device.'=>'Olùṣọ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan ní láti tan ún nínú Àpótí Ìwọlé, lórí ẹ̀rọ kọ̀ọ̀kan.','Slack incoming webhook URL'=>'URL webhook abọ̀ ti Slack','Microsoft Teams webhook URL'=>'URL webhook ti Microsoft Teams','Telegram bot token'=>'Token bot Telegram','Telegram chat ID'=>'ID iwiregbe Telegram','Webhook URLs (Zapier, Make, your own)'=>'Awọn URL Webhook (Zapier, Make, tirẹ)','One https:// address per line. Each event is sent as signed JSON.'=>'Adirẹsi https:// kan fun ila kọọkan. A n fi iṣẹlẹ kọọkan ranṣẹ gẹgẹ bi JSON ti a fọwọ si.','Webhook signing secret'=>'Ìkọ̀kọ̀ ìtọwọ̀bọ̀ Webhook','Empty: one is made for you. The X-Zinn-Chat-Signature header carries sha256= and the HMAC of the body.'=>'Òfo: a ti dá ọ̀kan fún ọ. Olùgbà áhìwì X-Zinn-Chat-Signature gbé sha256= àti HMAC ti ara rẹ̀.','Rules'=>'Àwọn Òfin','One per line: page | when | message. Page: * for every page, or part of the address such as /pricing. When: a number of seconds, exit (leaving the page) or 50% (scrolled half way). Example: /pricing | 20 | Questions about our plans? We are here.'=>'Ènìkan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan: ojú-ewé | nígbà tí | ìránṣẹ́. Ojú-ewé: * fún ojú-ewé kọ̀ọ̀kan, tàbí apá kan àdírẹ́sì bíi /pricing. Nígbà tí: nọ́mbà àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá, exit (kúrò lórí ojú-ewé náà) tàbí 50% (tí a lọ sí àárín). Àpẹẹrẹ: /pricing | 20 | Àwọn ìbéèrè nípa àwọn ètò wa? A wà níhìn-ín.','Help desk name'=>'Orúkọ ibùdó ìrànlọ́wọ́','Shown in wp-admin, on the agent app and on emails in place of Zinn® Chat.'=>'Wọn fi hàn nínú wp-admin, lórí ìṣègùn app àti lórí àwọn imeeli ní ipò Zinn® Chat.','Logo URL'=>'URL Logo','An https:// image, for emails and the agent app.'=>'Àwòrán https:// kan, fún àwọn íméèlì àti ìṣọ̀kan olùrànlọ́wọ́.','Email footer'=>'Fùtá fọ́ọ́tà ìmélì','Tone'=>'Ohùn','Friendly'=>'Ọrẹ','Professional'=>'Ọ̀jọ̀gbọ́n','Short and to the point'=>'Kúrúsì kí ó sì dé ojú kókó','Playful'=>'Ere','Persona'=>'Aláìlẹgbẹ','Who the assistant is, for example: "Sam, who has worked in our bakery for ten years."'=>'Ẹni tí olùrànlọ́wọ́ náà jẹ́, fún àpẹẹrẹ: "Sam, ẹni tí ó ti ʃiʃẹ́ ní ilé ìséè buuluu wa fún ọdún mẹ́wàá."','Hand over to a person when a visitor writes'=>'Fa itọju le ẹni kan lọ́wọ́ nígbà tí alábẹwò kan bá kọ̀wé','Words or phrases, one per line, for example: refund, complaint, cancel my order.'=>'Awọn ọrọ tabi gbolohun, ọkan fun ila kan, fun apẹẹrẹ: agapada, ẹdun, fagile aṣẹ mi.','Hand over at once when the assistant cannot answer and someone is online'=>'Fi silẹ lẹsẹkẹsẹ nigbati oluranlọwọ ko le dahun ti ẹnikan ba wa lori ayelujara','Tag, summarise and prioritise new tickets with AI'=>'Fi aami si, se akojopo ati se pataki si awon tiketi tuntun pelu AI','Keep a list of the questions the assistant could not answer'=>'Pa ako awọn ibeere ti oluranlọwọ ko le dahun','Also read these pages and sitemaps'=>'Tun ka awọn oju-iwe ati sitemap wọnyi','One address per line, on this site or another (a help centre, a documentation site). A sitemap adds every page in it. Re-read every day.'=>'Adirẹsi kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan, lórí ojula yìí tàbí òmíràn (ilé ìrànlọ́wọ́, ojula ìwé àṣẹ). Maapu aaye kan (sitemap) fi ojú ewé kọ̀ọ̀kan kún un. Tun ka ni ojo kọọkan.','Ask customers to rate the help they got when a ticket is solved'=>'Bẹ́ wọn ní àwọn oníbàárà láti fún  ìrànlọ́wọ́ tí wọ́n gbà ní ìwọ̀n nígbà tí wọ́n yanjú tìkẹ́ẹ̀tì kan','Webhook address for your email service (Postmark, Mailgun, SendGrid, Cloudflare Email Routing, or any service that can post the message as JSON):'=>'Àdírẹ́sì Webhook fún iṣẹ́ imeèlì rẹ (Postmark, Mailgun, SendGrid, Cloudflare Email Routing, tàbí èyíkéyìí iṣẹ́ tó lè fi ìfiránṣẹ́ náà ránṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí JSON):','Keep it private: anyone with it could add replies. Save the settings with a new mode to change it.'=>'Jẹ́ kí ó wà ní ìkọ̀kọ̀: ẹnikẹni tí ó bá ní í lè fi àwọn ìdáhùn kún un. Fi àwọn ètò náà pamọ́ pẹ̀lú ipò tuntun kan láti yí i padà.','Last check: %1$s. %2$s'=>'Àyẹ̀wò tó gbẹ̀yìn: %1$s. %2$s','Low'=>'Kékeré','Normal'=>'Deede','High'=>'Giga','Urgent'=>'Kakanju','Monday'=>'Ọjọ́ Ajé','Tuesday'=>'Ọjọ́ Ìṣẹ́gun','Wednesday'=>'Ọjọ́rú','Thursday'=>'Ọjọ́bọ̀','Friday'=>'Ọjọ́ Ẹtì','Saturday'=>'Ọjọ́ Àbámẹ́ta','Sunday'=>'Ọjọ́ Àìkú','Dismiss'=>'Pa kuro','Push notifications are not available on this site.'=>'Àwọn ìkéde ìgbéga kò sí lórí ojú òpó wẹ̀bù yìí.','%1$d waiting in chat · %2$d open tickets'=>'%1$d oluduro ninu iwiregbe · %2$d tiketi ti o wa ni sisi','Answer chats and tickets.'=>'Dahun awọn iwiregbe ati awọn tikẹti.','Reports'=>'Àwọn ìròyìn','Show the chat'=>'Fi iwiregbe naa han','On every page'=>'Lórí gbogbo ojú ewé','Only on the pages below'=>'Nikan lori awọn oju-iwe ti o wa ni isalẹ','Everywhere except the pages below'=>'Gbogbo ibi yato si awọn oju-iwe ti o wa ni isalẹ','Pages (IDs; 0 = the front page)'=>'Àwọn ojúewé (Àwọn ID; 0 = ojúewé iwájú)','Post types'=>'Àwọn irú ìfiṣé sílẹ̀','Hide from signed-in users'=>'Fi pamọ́ kúrò lọ́dọ̀ awọn olumulo tiwọn wọle','Cloudflare Turnstile site key'=>'Bọtìni aaye Cloudflare Turnstile','Optional bot check on new chats and ticket forms.'=>'Ayẹwo bọọti ti kii ṣe dandan lori awọn iwiregbe tuntun ati awọn fọọmu tikẹti.','Cloudflare Turnstile secret key'=>'Bọtìnnì àṣírí Cloudflare Turnstile','%ds'=>'%ds','%dm'=>'%dm','%dh'=>'%dh','Agent'=>'Aṣoju','Internal note'=>'Àkọsílẹ inú','With the assistant'=>'Pẹ̀lú olùrànlọ́wọ́','Waiting for a person'=>'Nduro eniyan kan','With an agent'=>'Pẹ̀lú aṣojú kan','Left a message'=>'Fi ifiranṣẹ silẹ','Away'=>'Kuro','Focus mode'=>'Ipo idojukọ','Desktop alerts'=>'Àwọn ìkìlọ̀ ojú ojú-iṣẹ́','Needs a person'=>'O nilo eniyan kan','Choose a chat on the left. You can open several; each keeps its own draft.'=>'Yan iwiregbe kan ni apa osi. O le ṣii pupọ; eeyan kọọkan n tọju àkọọkọ tirẹ.','A visitor is waiting'=>'Alejo kan n duro','Chat #%d'=>'Ìjìròorò #%d','Nothing here right now.'=>'Kò sí ohun kankan níbí báyìí.','Visitor #%d'=>'Alejo #%d','typing…'=>'ńkọwe lọwọ…','waiting %s'=>'nduro %s','%d online'=>'%d lori intaneti','Close tab'=>'Pa taabu kúrò','Back to the list'=>'Pad bẹ sí àkójọ náà','Type a reply… (Enter to send, Shift+Enter for a new line)'=>'Tẹ esi... (Tẹ bọtini Enter lati firanṣẹ, Shift+Enter fun ila titun)','Ticket #%d'=>'Tiketi #%d','Take this chat'=>'Gba iwiregbe yii','Back to the assistant'=>'Pad bẹ sí olùrànlọ́wọ́ náà','Make a ticket'=>'Ṣe tikẹeti kan','The visitor\'s email address'=>'Adirẹsi imeeli alejo naa','The visitor is typing…'=>'Olẹ̀wò náà ń tẹ̀...','New ticket'=>'Tiki ti o tun','Search subject, email or number'=>'Ṣàwárí kókó, íméèlì tàbí nọ́mbà','Customer'=>'Onibara','Priority'=>'Àkọkọ','Needs attention'=>'O nilo akiyesi','All'=>'Gbogbo','No tickets.'=>'Kò sí tikẹ́tì.','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Ojú-ewé %1$d nínú %2$d','Customer name'=>'Orúkọ oníbàárà','Customer email'=>'Ímeeli Onibara','Create ticket'=>'Ṣẹ́ tìkẹ́tì','All tickets'=>'Gbogbo tiketi','Write a reply…'=>'Kọ ìdáhùn kan…','Internal note (the customer does not see it)'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ inú (oníbàárà kò ní rí i)','then: waiting for customer'=>'lẹ́yìn náà: ó ń dúró de oníbàárà','then: solved'=>'lẹ́yìn náà: yanjú','then: keep open'=>'lẹhinna: tọju rẹ sí sílẹ̀','#%1$d %2$s'=>'#%1$d %2$s','by email'=>'nípasẹ̀ imeèlì','internal note'=>'akọsilẹ abẹnu','Channel'=>'Ikanni','Nobody'=>'Kò sí ẹnikẹni','Assigned to'=>'A yọ fún','Order #%1$s · %2$s · %3$s'=>'Àṣẹ #%1$s · %2$s · %3$s','Delete ticket'=>'Pa tikẹti rẹ','Delete this ticket and all its messages?'=>'Ṣé o fẹ́ pa tikẹ́tì yìí rẹ́ pẹ̀lú gbogbo àwọn ìránṣẹ́ rẹ̀?','Ask what your visitors ask. You see the answer and every page it found, with how well each matched, when it was last updated, and warnings for pages that look out of date. Fix a page, press Re-read, and ask again.'=>'Bẹ́ni ohun tí àwọn àlejò rẹ ń bi. O rí ìdáhùn náà àti ojú-ewé kọ̀ọ̀kan tí ó rí, pẹ̀lú bí ẹnì kọ̀ọ̀kan ṣe bá mu tó, ìgbà tí a kẹ́yìn ṣe é ní títúnṣe, àti àwọn ìkìlọ̀ fún àwọn ojú-ewé tí ó dà bí èyí tí ó ti pé ọjọ́. Ṣe àtúnṣe ojú-ewé kan, tẹ Re-read, kí o sì tún bi í lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','For example: What is your returns policy?'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ: Kini eto ìdápadà rẹ?','Ask'=>'Bi ni ibeere','Not updated for over a year'=>'Kò tíì ṣe àtúnṣe fún ju ọdún kan lọ','A newer page covers the same subject: %s'=>'Ojú-ewé tuntun kan wà tí ó sọ nípa kókó kan náà: %s','Re-read ✓'=>'Ka lẹẹkan sí i ✓','Asking…'=>'Ń béèrè lọ́wọ́…','Outcome: %1$s · Search: %2$s · Tokens: %3$d in, %4$d out'=>'Èsì: %1$s · Àwárí: %2$s · Àmì: %3$d nínú, %4$d jáde','by meaning and words'=>'nípa ìtumọ̀ àti àwọn ọ̀rọ̀','by words only (no embedding key)'=>'nípa àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ nìkan (kò sí bọ́tìnnì ìfúngbá)','nothing indexed'=>'kò sí ohun tí a ṣe àkọsílẹ̀ rẹ̀','The AI is not set up yet or could not answer.'=>'A ò tíì ṣètò AI tàbí kò lè dáhùn.','Sources found (%d)'=>'Awọn orisun ti a rii (%d)','Nothing on the site matched. Add a page that answers this, or check the Site index settings.'=>'Ko si nkan lori aaye na ti o baamu. Fi oju-iwe kan kun ti o dahun eyi, tabi ṣayẹwo awọn eto atọka aaye naa.','Score'=>'Àmìì','Last updated'=>'Ìgbà tí a ṣe àtúnṣe gbẹ̀yìn','Passage'=>'Ọ̀nà ìkọjá','Edit'=>'Ṣatunṣe','Re-read'=>'Tun ka','What the assistant has read'=>'Ohun ti oluranlọwọ ti ka','%1$d pages read · %2$d waiting · %3$d with errors · %4$d passages · %5$d understood by meaning'=>'Awọn oju-iwe %1$d ti ka · %2$d n duro · %3$d pẹlu awọn asise · %4$d awọn apakan · %5$d ti a loye nipasẹ itumọ','Embedding model: %s'=>'Àwoṣe ìfúnni: %s','No embedding model: search is by words only. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to search by meaning.'=>'Ko si awoṣe ifibọ: wiwa jẹ nipasẹ awọn ọrọ nikan. Sopọ Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tabi OpenRouter lati wa nipasẹ itumo.','Building meanings is paused:'=>'A kọ́ ẹ̀sẹ̀ wà ní ìsinmi:','Re-read the whole site'=>'Tun ka gbogbo aaye naa atunyẹwo','Rebuild all meanings'=>'Tún gbogbo ìtumọ̀ ṣe','Filter by title or address'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ nípa àkọlé tàbí àdírẹ́sì','Read'=>'Ka','Waiting'=>'Nduro','Errors'=>'Awọn aṣiṣe','Passages'=>'Àwọn Apá','by meaning'=>'nípa ìtumọ̀','Rebuild meaning'=>'Tún itumo rẹ ṣe','Done ✓'=>'Se e pari ✓','Failed'=>'Kòṣeéṣe','%d second'=>'%d aaya-aya','%d minute'=>'%d ìṣúju','%d hour'=>'wakati %d','%d day'=>'Ọjọ %d','This browser cannot receive push notifications here. On an iPhone, add the Inbox to your Home Screen first.'=>'Ẹrọ aṣàwákiri yìí kò le gba àwọn ìfitónilétí ìtì níhìn-ín. Lori iPhone kan, fi Inbox kún Ojú-ìwé Ilé rẹ kọkọ.','Notifications are blocked for this site in the browser settings.'=>'A kò gba àwọn ìfitónilétí láàyè fún ojú òpó wẹ́bù yìí nínú ètò àṣàyàn ẹ̀rọ ìwákiri (browser) rẹ.','Notifications are on for this device.'=>'Àwọn ìfitónilétí ti wà ní tító sílẹ̀ fún ẹ̀rọ yìí.','Send a test notification'=>'Fi ìmọ̀ ìjẹ́rìísí ìdánwò ránṣẹ́','Sent. It should appear in a few seconds.'=>'O ti ránṣẹ́. Ó yẹ kí ó hàn ní ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ sẹ́yìn.','The push service did not accept it.'=>'Iṣẹ ìtì náà kò gba a.','Could not turn notifications on.'=>'Kò le sọ àwọn ìfitónilétí di ṣíṣe.','Phone app and notifications'=>'Ohun elo foonu ati awọn iwifunni','Install this Inbox as an app: in Chrome or Edge choose Install in the address bar or menu; on an iPhone or iPad tap Share, then Add to Home Screen. It opens full screen, ready to answer.'=>'Fi Inbox yìí sori ẹrọ gẹgẹbi app: ninu Chrome tabi Edge yan Fi sori ẹrọ ninu ọpa adirẹsi tabi akojọ aṣyn; lori iPhone tabi iPad tẹ Pinpín, lẹhinna Fi kun si Iboju Ile. O ṣii ni kikun iboju, o ṣetan lati dahun.','Turn on notifications on this device'=>'Tan awọn àmúṣẹ́ sílẹ̀ lórí ẹ̀rọ yìí','Nothing found.'=>'Kò sí ohun tí a rí.','Search saved replies'=>'Wa awọn idahun ti a fipamọ','Link an article'=>'Sopọ nǹkan kika kan','Search the knowledge base'=>'Wá ibi ìmọ̀ ìpìlẹ̀ rẹ̀','Suggest a reply'=>'Daba esi kan','Drafting…'=>'Nítorí pé ó ń kọ…','Replace what you have typed with the suggestion?'=>'Ṣé o fẹ́ rọ́pò ohun tí o ti tẹ́ pẹ̀lu ìṣíṣẹ́ náà?','%s is writing a reply to this too.'=>'%s nko idahun si eyi pẹlu.','%s is also looking at this.'=>'%s náà tún ń wò this.',